<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Akebou: La Bible en Akebou</book>
  <para style="h">Oromatǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oro</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oromatǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔlʊ la kǝfwɛɛkǝ we ŋ na ŋʊrʊ ŋ na maŋ Oromatǝpǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔlʊ la kǝfwɛɛkǝ we ŋ na ŋʊrʊ ŋ na maŋ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oromatǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ŋwaataanǝtierǝ</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔlʊ ŋ na ŋʊrʊ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa pǝ lóo pwo ǝkǝnǝŋ Oromatǝpǝ la kǝfwɛɛkǝ wǝ. Ŋʊ̀rʊ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa manǝ Kǝriso la wǝcakukpǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ Roma wǝ. Rǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa mǝrǝ we, la pɔrʊ la kaŋ kǝ́ nyɩmaasɩyǝ ŋ náa siɛrɩ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ saŋ rǝ kǝ́ yǝ we ŋ na lɔ Yesu Kǝriso ŋ no nuŋ wǝ. La tɛŋ wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ anyɩmaasɩpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ, mǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ mǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lǝ mǝrǝ, wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ pǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ saŋ rǝ pǝla anǝnɛyǝ. Paa Worokoyǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ nyiyǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ mǝŋ yǝ we la lɔ Yesu Kǝriso lo nuŋ wǝǝ. Rǝ wǝla kǝmaakǝ Pɔlʊ la wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ vɔrʊŋwɛŋrǝ we nyɩmaasɩyǝ we ŋ ne yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Kǝriso ŋ née tii wǝ. Wǝtaarǝkpǝ wǝ kpii rǝ lɔnuŋtǝyǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ le kǝtiitiikǝ, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ lóo koonu kǝ nyiyǝ ŋ ru rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝ gbɛŋrǝ lo okopiyǝ mǝrǝ. Pɔlʊ tǝ ya láa pɔrʊ Worokoyǝ la alɔkuŋkǝ lo yupurǝ we ŋ ne yee ŋ na tɛɛ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ mǝ ŋ kaŋ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9-11">9–11</ref></char>). Rǝ yupurǝ sa mǝrǝ we, la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ la pɔrʊ Oyudatǝpǝ saŋ rǝ garǝ we ŋ cò pǝlǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ: La saa pǝ la pɔrʊ pǝ ri nǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ na pɔrʊ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ saŋ rǝ na lɛsiɛrɩwǝ. Rǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa la fɛɛtuturuwǝ we, la wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ kǝ́ ekǝrisotǝpǝ pǝ lée tii vɔrʊrǝ mǝ awɛ pǝ fǝ, kǝ́ pǝ láa pɛɛlɩ pǝ koonu asaatiitǝpǝ pǝ fǝ. Rǝ kǝlɛɛkǝ we, Pɔlʊ le ceeni ne enyicipǝ rǝ Roma, wǝ́ ŋ ya ŋ náa kpaka ŋ po ko ŋ ka yɩrɩ pǝ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yǝ lóo koru ǝsǝpǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa la saŋ eni:</para>
  <para style="io">- Ŋwaataanǝtierǝ 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io">- Anyɩmaasɩpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ we, oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ 1:18–3:20</para>
  <para style="io">- Worokoyǝ la alɔkuŋkǝ la gʊŋrǝ 3:21–4:25</para>
  <para style="io">- Vɔrʊŋwɛŋrǝ rǝ Kǝriso mǝrǝ 5:1–8:39</para>
  <para style="io">- Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ le kǝtiikǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ lo yupurǝ 9:1–11:36</para>
  <para style="io">- Ekǝrisotǝpǝ lǝ wǝlǝkpǝ 12:1–15:13</para>
  <para style="io">- Etietuturuyǝ mǝ eceenikǝ 15:14–16:27</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Eceenikǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Ŋmǝ Pɔlʊ ŋ́ na ŋʊrʊ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa ŋ́ na maŋ nǝ. Yesu Kǝriso la sʊmatǝyǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ ri. Worokoyǝ ŋ no pwo mǝ ŋ́ pe ri nyikpiiyǝ wǝ́ ŋ na saa mǝ ŋ na pɔrʊ kǝ ŋ́ tɛŋ ne Dieceeceerǝ.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Worokoyǝ sanǝ rǝ na akpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ lǝ oŋuŋkǝ wǝ́ ŋ cò Dieceeceerǝ sa la garǝ rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ mǝrǝ ǝrǝ eniyǝ nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Dieceeceerǝ sa ya láa wɛɛlɩ lǝ ŋ ru rǝ ŋwǝ Worokoyǝ le Piyǝ. Pǝ mǝnǝ ŋwǝ mǝŋ nyɩmaasɩyǝ kǝtǝ rǝ Davidǝ lǝ wǝmǝkpǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Kǝ́ ŋ na saanǝ ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ mǝrǝ we, wǝ́ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ bɔ̀rʊ ganǝ mǝ okopiyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso ŋ ri Worokoyǝ le Piyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Saŋ rǝ Yesu lo oŋuŋkǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ na nya lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝ ŋ́ ri nyikpiiyǝ koonu Kǝriso la nyɩŋrurǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ koonu kǝ wǝkpǝŋtuturukpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le enyipǝ pǝ lɔ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ kǝ pǝ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ nǝ kʊla mǝ ŋpǝ enyipǝ sa, ŋnǝ epǝ we Yesu Kǝriso ŋ no pwo wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa ŋʊrʊ mǝ ŋ maŋ ŋnǝ epǝ we kpǝlo nǝ kpii rǝ Roma, ŋnǝ epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ náa taa kǝǝwǝ wǝ́ ŋ no pwo nǝ nǝ pe tii vɔrʊrǝ nǝ koonu ŋwǝ wǝ. Lǝh Tǝ Worokoyǝ mǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso pǝ yee nǝ lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝ pǝ koonu nǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlʊ le ceeni Worokoyǝ rǝ ekǝrisotǝpǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ Roma lo yurǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Coŋ koonu tu ri ŋ tu we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née ceeni mǝ Worokoyǝ rǝ nǝ kpǝlo lo yurǝ saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso. Duturǝ ɖi pǝ ya pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ pǝ ŋ ru rǝ nǝ lɔnuŋrǝ rǝ ǝrǝkǝ kpǝlo. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Worokoyǝ we ŋ́ nǝ fǝ mǝ wɛ kpǝlo ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee anǝnɛyǝ mǝ ŋ koonu rǝ ne Pi le Dieceeceerǝ we la atɛŋkǝ we, lée ri ɖaŋsieyǝ ŋ koonu mǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ kǝceece, vǝ́ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ we, ŋ́ náa taalǝ nǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Eni ri ŋ ni vǝ́ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ we, ŋ́ née tíi Worokoyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ mǝŋ wǝ ponu mǝ ŋwǝ we kǝ ŋ koonu kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Duturǝ ɖi wǝ ya wǝ láa ca mǝ kpɛɛwǝ ŋpa kǝ ŋ́ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ, kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ po toŋ nǝ kǝ nǝ lɔ wɛɛrǝ lo otukoonuyǝ rɛ. Mǝŋkǝsa we nǝ nyáa tɔ nǝ yaa rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ vǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ we kǝ loh kpǝlo la pa nya fɛɛ le kpii awɛ la wɛɛlɛŋwǝ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ nǝ ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ tǝnǝ eciyǝ eni ri ŋ ni kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ paape po ro ruŋruŋ ŋ́ faa nya gʊŋrǝ ŋ́ pǝ. Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ kǝ mǝ anǝnɛyǝ yǝ ko kǝnyɩŋkǝ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ mǝŋ kǝ́ yǝ lo ko kǝnyɩŋkǝ rǝ wǝkpǝŋpʊŋpwakpǝ lǝ kpǝŋ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Wǝ kaamǝ kǝ ŋ́ ko enyipǝ kpǝlo lǝ kpǝŋ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri epǝ we pǝ lo wuru enimiyǝ amaa epǝ we pǝ loo wuru enimiyǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, epǝ we pǝ sieni nimirǝ amaa epǝ we pǝ lee sie nimirǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Duturǝ ɖi mǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ kǝ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Tuwǝ kǝto ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ pa tɛŋ Worokoŋtierǝ ŋ́ tíi ŋnǝ epǝ we nǝ kpii rǝ Roma ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ wǝǝ.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Worokoŋtierǝ lo okopiyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ŋ́ nǝŋ suu nʊŋsɔɔwǝ rǝ Worokoŋtierǝ la atɛŋkǝ, duturǝ ɖi Worokoŋtierǝ sa ɖi rǝ okopiyǝ rɛ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ mǝ ŋ pɔrʊ epǝ we kpǝlo pǝ la lɔ rǝ pǝ lo nuŋ wǝ, wǝ lǝ sǝŋ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ kpɛŋ, wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ ci atɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Duturǝ ɖi Dieceeceerǝ we la pɔrʊ la kaŋ wǝlǝkpǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ náa siɛrɩ anyɩmaasɩpǝ mǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ. Worokoyǝ lée yee tuwǝ sa mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ kǝ́ anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ la lɔ ŋwǝ ceŋceŋ ko pǝ lo nuŋ, wǝ́ lɔnuŋrǝ sa ceŋceŋ lo ro. Mǝŋ kǝ́ pǝ la tɛŋ wǝ rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ we ŋ kʊʊ saŋ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ we, lée tii vɔrʊrǝ».<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ lo wǝtoomwarakpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ǝrǝ yulaarǝ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ŋ na tɛɛ rǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ mǝ kǝ́ pǝ lǝŋ suu ŋwǝ Worokoyǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ pǝlo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ kpǝlo kǝto. Ŋyǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ sa yǝ lǝ́ǝ sǝŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ la gʊŋrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ la pɔrʊ na wɛ la kaŋ nyi ri ŋ nyi, kǝto nyi ri ŋ nyi cii yǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ ri sɩsiɛrɩ. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kǝceece, rɛ lǝŋ nyɩŋ Worokoyǝ mǝ enimiyǝ, paape ru ǝrǝ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ no co ǝrǝkǝ we, yǝ lóo koru anyɩŋ no okopilaalɛɛyǝ mǝ ne wǝpilikpǝ le ci, vǝ́ yǝ lóo co nimirǝ sɩsiɛrɩ yǝ láa yɩrɩ otuyǝ we ŋ no co wǝ. Kǝto anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ lǝŋ po koru ǝsǝrǝ kafǝrawǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Duturǝ ɖi pǝ cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ kpii, paape pǝ lǝǝ fǝ nǝ ǝkǝkǝ mǝ ne eceenikǝ pǝ koonu ŋwǝ. Paa wǝ́ pǝ la siɛrɩ pǝlo oyupuyǝ pǝ lo ko rǝ otukpaakpaayǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, wǝ́ pǝlo oyupukpaakpaayǝ sa yǝ le ke kpii rǝ nuŋtumuwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Pǝ láa nyɩŋ pǝla wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋpǝ pǝ cii otuyǝ, paape owuupǝ wǝ́ pǝ ri. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Kǝto kaa kǝ pǝ ka sʊma rǝ wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ lo Worokoyǝ we ŋ nǝŋ kpǝ́ we, wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ láa sʊma rǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ le etiŋyǝ, ofuripǝ wǝkparǝniǝkpǝ mǝ akɛɛtiinipǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Tuwǝ kǝto Worokoyǝ ŋ na maa pǝ ŋ no co pǝ ŋ yee rǝ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ we pǝ láa taa kǝǝwǝ wǝ, kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ fǝ pǝla kǝwɛlɛŋfwɛɛkǝ pǝ ŋ yee anʊŋsɔɔtǝtuyǝ mǝ awɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Pǝ la lɛ pǝ la siɛrɩ Worokoyǝ la anʊkɔrǝyǝ pǝ le yee niarǝ. Pǝ láa sʊma rǝ Worokoyǝ lo otuyeeyǝ wǝ́ pǝ lée ci yǝ le ere sɩsiɛrɩ, kaa kǝ pǝ ka sʊma yǝ we ŋ ne yee ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa wǝ. Ŋwǝ ŋ kaamǝ ǝkǝkǝ kǝkpakǝkpa. Amɛnǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Tuwǝ kǝto Worokoyǝ ŋ na maa pǝ ŋ no co koonu pǝle eyeputǝtucakpɛɛyǝ wǝǝ. Pǝle etiepǝ pǝ lǝŋ tǝ pǝ kpɛɛ mǝ pǝlo onuŋpǝ, paa pǝ ŋ mǝ kpɛɛ mǝ etiepʊŋpwapǝ. Worokoyǝ lǝǝ pǝ́ wǝ ǝnǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Kǝ́ ǝpǝrǝŋpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee wǝǝ. Pǝ lǝŋ tǝ pǝ kpɛɛ mǝ pǝle etiepǝ, wǝ́ ǝpǝrǝŋpǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa ca awɛ la kpɛɛwǝ ŋpa. Wǝ́ ǝpǝrǝŋpǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa kpɛɛ mǝ ǝpǝrǝŋpǝ, kǝ́ le eyeputǝtuyǝ wǝǝ! Wǝ kǝto ŋpǝŋpǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa lɔ pǝlo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ sa lo tukoŋtawǝ wǝǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kǝ́ pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ pǝ lǝŋ ci Worokoyǝ we, kǝto Worokoyǝ la maa pǝ lo co mǝ pǝle nimisiekpaakpaawǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee otuyǝ yǝ laa laka eyee wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Pǝ lǝ lǝ pwɩ mǝ otulaakʊʊyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le eyeekǝ, kǝtʊkpaakǝ enyipǝ lo otuyǝ le nimimwɛɛrɩwǝ, yulɛnyɩrǝ, otuyǝ yǝ lǝŋ roo pǝ kʊrakʊra, kǝnyiwʊkǝ, akpaŋyǝ, kǝnyitǝǝnǝkǝ, wǝlǝrɔɔrɔɔkpǝ, kǝnyitɛŋkǝ <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />kǝnyipǝlǝkǝ, pǝ lǝ́ǝ kpǝlǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ, pǝ láa fɛɛpɩ enyipǝ, pǝ láa rɛɛrɩ mǝ pǝla wɛ, pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ otukǝŋkǝŋtuyǝ, pǝ lée ci turɔɔrɔɔwǝ le eyeekǝ, pǝ lǝŋ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ pǝlǝ ǝtǝpǝ mǝ eleepǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Pǝ puru, pǝ lǝŋ yee pǝ saŋ rǝ pǝlo tutɛŋwǝ, pǝ tǝnǝ ziɔŋrǝ, pǝ lǝŋ nyɩŋ nyiyǝ la tǝlarǝwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Pǝ cii wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ le seyǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lée yee oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ sa wǝrʊʊkpǝ we, wǝ kpii kǝ pǝ kpǝ́. Paape pǝ tǝ pǝ re pǝ ya pǝ lée yee yǝ rǝ ko. Tǝ fǝ kʊla we, vǝ́ pǝ la nyɩŋ enyipʊŋpwapǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa we, ǝ pǝ ŋ mǝ tɛŋ pǝ ŋ kpii mǝ pǝ.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ la wǝkpaŋtɛŋkpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ŋlǝ́ yǝ we a ya láa tɛŋ enyipǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ, e ke ri rǝ ǝlǝ, kafǝrawǝ rɛ wǝ lee kpii ǝ lǝ́ǝ sǝrǝ. Vǝ́ a ya láa tɛŋ apʊŋpwapǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ we, ŋlǝ́ŋlǝ́ a ya láa tɔɔ lá wɛ la bɔrǝ kpiikǝ ŋlǝ́ kpaŋtɛŋtǝyǝ sa we, e lée yee mǝŋ ŋpǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ láa tɛŋ epǝ we pǝ lée yee ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa wǝrʊʊkpǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ mǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ŋlǝ́, otuyǝ we apʊŋpwapǝ pǝ le yee ǝkǝ a ya láa tɛŋ pǝla wǝkpaŋkpǝ we, ŋlǝ́ŋlǝ́ a ya lée yee yǝ. Kǝto o lo pu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ a lah pa cɛ Worokoyǝ la wǝkpaŋtɛŋkpǝ? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Amaa kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ ponu ŋpa, ŋ taarǝ lɛrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ nǝŋ fuunu kǝto wǝ́ o loo co oku rǝ ŋwǝ wǝ? E lee ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ wǝlǝceeceekpǝ sa wǝ ya wǝ lóo kuŋ kǝ a siɛrɩ vɔrʊrǝ rǝ? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Paape a laa ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ o nuŋ duturǝ. A laa ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ a siɛrɩ vɔrʊrǝ. Kǝto ŋlǝ́ŋlǝ́ a ya láa kpaka tukoŋtawǝ lo mumuŋwǝ ǝ mǝ ŋ tǝnǝ lá wɛ jirǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ náa pɔrʊ na kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ŋ kaŋ wǝ. Jirǝ we we, Worokoyǝ láa tɛŋ akpaŋyǝ rǝ wǝkʊʊkpǝ, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />kǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ lɔ tuwǝ we ŋ ne yee lo wǝtoomwarakpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Epǝ we pǝ láa nyɩɩ pǝ ŋ yee wǝceeceekpǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ po koonu pǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ, ǝkǝkǝ mǝ vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ we, Worokoyǝ loh po koonu pǝ pǝ tii vɔrʊrǝ kǝkpakǝkpa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Paa epǝ we pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ ŋwǝ pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ, wǝ́ paa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ ponu mǝ pǝ we, Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛmʊrʊmumuŋwǝ we wǝ láa sʊʊ rǝ pǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee rɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, Worokoyǝ lóo kuŋ pǝ cʊʊrʊ ŋpa kǝ pǝ fii vurǝ, Oyudatǝpǝ kpɛŋ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Paa epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lée yee wǝceeceekpǝ we, Worokoyǝ lóo koonu pǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ, ǝkǝkǝ mǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ, Oyudatǝpǝ kpɛŋ, mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ lǝŋ lɔ ŋ kpii mǝ rɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ, pǝ lee ci Mose le seyǝ, vǝ́ pǝ le yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ́ pǝ lǝ kpǝ́ we, Worokoyǝ lǝŋ fǝ seyǝ sa ŋ tɛŋ pǝla wǝkpaŋkpǝ. Paa Oyudatǝpǝ we, ŋpǝ pǝ cii Mose le seyǝ. Vǝ́ pǝ le yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, Worokoyǝ láa tɛŋ pǝla wǝkpaŋkpǝ saŋ rǝ ŋwǝ seyǝ sa lo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋkǝ epǝ we pǝ lóo nuŋ seyǝ we pǝ ri enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ le enimiyǝ, paa epǝ we pǝ lée yee pǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ seyǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Mǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ, wǝ́ pǝ lee ci Mose le seyǝ, ŋpǝŋpǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee pǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ seyǝ sa lo tuwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ we, wǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ seyǝ sa kpii pǝ rǝ ziɔŋrǝ mǝrǝ, mǝŋkǝ́ pǝ lee ci ŋwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Pǝ ya pǝ láa pɔrʊ pǝ ŋ kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ tuwǝ we seyǝ ŋ ya ŋ náa tɛŋ pǝ yee we, wǝ kpii pǝ rǝ pǝla ziɔŋrǝ. Pǝla ziɔŋrǝ ŋrǝ ŋkpɛ ya lée ri tuwǝ sa la ɖaŋsieyǝ. Wǝ́ pǝlo oyupuyǝ we yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ yǝ ŋ tɔɔ pǝla bɔrǝ mǝ enirɛɛyǝ amaa yǝ láa pɛɛnɩ pǝ mǝ enirɛɛyǝ we, ŋyǝ ŋkpɛ yǝ le ri wǝla ɖaŋsieyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Tuwǝ sa wǝ lah pa nyɩnɩ feŋteŋ, jirǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ náa saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso ŋ tɛŋ enyipǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ ŋ ru rǝ tu ri ŋ tu wǝ la ŋwaa wǝ kpii pǝ rǝ ziɔŋrǝ wǝ. Dieceeceerǝ sa ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɛŋ we, la tɛɛ wǝ la gaapirǝ.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ lee yee pǝ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ŋ́ re mǝ lǝ́, ŋlǝ́ yǝ ǝnǝ a ya láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ e ri Yudatǝpiyǝ, a la tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ Mose le seyǝ, wǝ́ a ya lǝ́ǝ kǝ lá wɛ rǝ kǝloŋkǝ we kǝ kpii rǝ ŋnǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ mǝrǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />E cii tuwǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ, wǝ́ seyǝ ŋ na kaŋ lǝ́ kǝ́ pǝ láa saa ceeceewǝ pǝ ŋ pɔrʊ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />A ya láa tɛŋ mǝ kpɛɛtɛɛwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ e ri retǝyǝ o koonu alaanyɩŋtǝpǝ. Ŋlǝ́ e ri wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ o koonu epǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ nuŋtumuwǝ, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />otuleecitǝpǝ lo tukaŋtǝyǝ, otukarǝtǝŋwɛŋpǝ lo tukaŋtǝyǝ. Awo, a la tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ kpiikǝ e cii Mose le seyǝ kǝto we, e cii tu ri ŋ tu sɩsiɛrɩ, wǝ́ tuwǝ a láa tɛŋ we, anʊkɔrǝyǝ yǝ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ŋlǝ́ yǝ ǝnǝ a ya láa kaŋ otuturupǝ lo otuyǝ wǝǝ, a lǝŋ kaŋ lá wɛ lo otuyǝ? Ŋlǝ́ yǝ a ya láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ paa yɩɩ, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a ya láa yɩɩ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ŋlǝ́ yǝ a ya láa tɛŋ pǝ pee yee kǝtienaakǝ, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a ya lée yee kǝtienaakǝ wǝ? Ŋlǝ́ yǝ ǝ lǝ́ǝ kpǝlǝ etiŋyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a la ka yɩɩ otuyǝ we yǝ kpɛlɩ rǝ etiŋyǝ lo wǝkukpǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />A ya lǝ́ǝ kǝ lá wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ e cii Mose le seyǝ paa a ya lée kpii Worokoyǝ le kǝyepukǝ rǝ kǝ́ a laa ya lée yee a mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ seyǝ lo tuwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ wǝ! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Wǝ kǝto Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋnǝ kǝto wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ rɔɔrɔ pǝ ŋ ru rǝ Worokoyǝ wǝ».<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kǝceece, mǝŋ a ya lée yee a mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ tuwǝ seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ we, a láa nyɩŋ ǝkǝǝlǝkǝ kǝ lǝǝmǝ vasʊyǝ kǝ koonu lǝ́. Paa mǝŋ e lǝŋ yee a saŋ rǝ tuwǝ seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ we, ǝ lǝ kǝǝlǝ paape ǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ nyiyǝ ŋ nǝǝ kǝǝlǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Kǝto mǝŋ fufoolǝtǝyǝ ya lée yee mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ tuwǝ Mose le seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ we, Worokoyǝ láa nyɩŋ ŋwǝ rǝ mǝŋ nyiyǝ ŋ nǝ kǝǝlǝ ŋ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Nyiyǝ we ŋ nǝǝ kǝǝlǝ, wǝ́ paa ŋ née yee mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ we, ŋwǝ ŋ nah pa ka tɛŋ ŋlǝ́ Yudatǝpiyǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ, duturǝ ɖi a laa ya lée yee a mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ. Kaŋfɩ ŋlǝ́ Yudatǝpiyǝ wǝ́ pǝ la ŋʊrʊ seyǝ sa pǝ lo koonu wǝ́ a la lɛ ǝ lǝ kǝǝlǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Duturǝ ɖi Yudatǝpipoŋpiyǝ we, ŋkǝ yǝ we ŋ née re na wɛ rǝ dǝǝtǝǝrǝ sa mǝŋ Yudatǝpiyǝ kǝtǝ, wǝ́ ǝkǝǝlǝpoŋpikǝ we, kǝ lee ri gǝ ǝnǝ pǝ lée yee rǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ rǝ dǝǝtǝǝrǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Paa Yudatǝpipoŋpiyǝ ŋ kaamǝ yǝ we ŋ ri Yudatǝpiyǝ rǝ mǝrǝ wǝ, wǝ́ ǝkǝǝlǝpoŋpikǝ kǝ kaamǝ ziɔŋrǝ lǝ ǝkǝǝlǝkǝ. Ǝkǝǝlǝkǝ sa wǝrʊʊkpǝ kǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, kǝ loo ru rǝ Mose le seyǝ sa pǝ la ŋʊrʊ lǝ kpǝŋ. Yudatǝpipoŋpiyǝ we, Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ kǝ ŋwǝ wǝ, ŋkǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Rɛ ŋ ri rɛ laa kʊʊ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Mǝŋ wǝ lǝ ǝnǝ wǝǝ, we kǝ́ wǝ́ Yudatǝpiyǝ ŋ fǝ ŋ teeri yǝ we ŋ nee ri Yudatǝpiyǝ wǝ? Ǝkǝǝlǝkǝ kǝ lǝǝmǝ vasʊyǝ rɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Awo, vasʊyǝ naanǝ rǝ ca ri ŋ ca. Sǝsǝŋwǝ Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ne etieyǝ ŋ kòonu wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Kǝceece, Oyudatǝrɛɛpǝ pǝ lee yee pǝ saŋ rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ. Kǝ́? Nǝ nyo pu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ́ǝ sǝ́ŋ nǝŋ tǝ ŋ ri nʊkɔrǝlǝtǝyǝ kpawǝ we pǝ lee yee pǝ saŋ rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ kǝto? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Kʊrakʊra! Worokoyǝ ri nʊkɔrǝlǝtǝyǝ! Wǝ́ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ ri rǝ nianiatǝyǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Wǝ kaamǝ kǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ nyɩŋ lǝ́ ŋ ci ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ a kʊʊ saŋ rǝ lá awɛɛlɩkǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">wǝ́ mǝŋ rɛ lǝ pǝ́ ŋ tɛŋ lá wǝkpaŋkpǝ we, pǝ láa pɛɛnɩ lǝ́».<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Paa mǝŋ rɔɔrɔɔwǝ we yǝ lée yee wǝ láa pɔrʊ Worokoyǝ la akʊʊkǝ wǝ kaŋ enyipǝ feŋteŋ wǝǝ, kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ? Kǝ lǝ pǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ laa kʊʊ mǝ kǝ́ na kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ wǝ la sʊʊ rǝ lǝ kǝto? (Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa wɛɛlɩ mǝŋ kǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ kǝtǝ oo). <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Kʊrakʊra! Worokoyǝ kʊʊ. Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ Worokoyǝ laa kʊʊ wǝǝ keh pe yee nɛ kǝ ŋ koru atɛŋ ǝrǝkǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Paa mǝŋ mǝ niarǝ lóo koonu kǝ Worokoyǝ la anʊkɔrǝyǝ yǝ nyɩnɩ feŋteŋ kǝ wǝ kǝ ŋwǝ wǝǝ, we kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ tǝ ŋ tɔɔ ŋmǝ mǝ bɔrǝ mǝŋ turɔɔrɔɔyeetǝyǝ kǝtǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Arɛɛpǝ pǝ ya pǝ láa fɛɛpɩ mǝ. Pǝ ya pǝ láa tɛɛ mǝ acɛɛyǝ ŋlǝ la ya yǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nǝ pǝ kǝ le yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝ tuceeceewǝ wǝ nyaa wǝ ru rǝ wǝlǝ mǝrǝ». Pǝ lah pa tɔɔ ŋpǝ enyipǝ sa la bɔrǝ!<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyikʊʊyǝ rɛ lee kpii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nǝ reemǝ nɛ? Ŋlǝ Oyudatǝpǝ lo tuwǝ wǝ ponu wǝ teeri epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ? Kʊrakʊra! Ŋ́ na pɔrʊ wǝ ŋ́ na kaŋ ŋ́ na pa tɛlɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ, mǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ mǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ, pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lo okopiyǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Nyikʊʊyǝ rɛ lee kpii, mǝŋ ceŋceŋ ǝkǝŋtǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Nimisietǝyǝ rɛ lee kpii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">rɛ lee kpii ŋ ya ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ saŋ mǝ Worokoyǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lǝ lǝǝ cawǝ, pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lǝ pǝlǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Rɛ lee kpii ŋ ya ŋ née yee tuceeceewǝ, mǝŋ ceŋceŋ ǝkǝŋtǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Pǝla akpɛɛmɩyǝ yǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ wǝfuŋkpǝ pǝ la taanǝ wǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">pǝlo wǝroŋfwɛɛkpǝ wǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝǝnǝ enyipǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">kǝpɔɔkǝ la wǝpwɛkpǝ ko wǝ lóo ru pǝ rǝ nyuŋkpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Vwɛɛrɩrǝ mǝ kaawǝ pʊrɩpʊrɩ lǝ lǝ gbii pǝ rǝ nyuŋkpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Pǝ fǝǝlǝ rǝ ŋpǝrayǝ la alʊkǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ pǝ lóo ko we, pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝlǝ otuyǝ, pǝ ŋ maa wǝrɔɔrɔɔkpǝ pǝ tǝnǝ enyipǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Pǝ lee ci kǝ́ pǝ lée tii mǝ awɛ mǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Worokoyǝ lo vusuurǝ mǝŋ tɩ lee kpii rǝ pǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Paa le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tu ri ŋ tu Worokoyǝ le seyǝ ŋ na tɛŋ we, la tɛŋ wǝ le tíi epǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ seyǝ sa mǝrǝ rǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, rɛ lǝŋ po koru owuru nyuŋkpǝ ŋ sǝrǝ kafǝrawǝ, wǝ́ ǝrǝkǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ la tɔɔ bɔrǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Wǝ kǝto rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ we, rɛ lee kpii ŋ neh pe ri nyikʊʊyǝ mǝ kǝ́ yǝ we ŋ ne yee ŋ na saŋ rǝ seyǝ sa lo tuwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi seyǝ sa we, lóo koonu enyipǝ pǝ nyɩŋ pǝlo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ pǝ ci rǝ ko feepi wǝǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ nyiyǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Paa rǝkǝsa we, Worokoyǝ la kaŋ lǝ kǝ́ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ wǝ, Mose le seyǝ la tǝrɛ wǝ laa kʊla. Mose le seyǝ sa ŋwǝŋwǝ fǝ kʊla mǝ akpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ pǝ le ri wǝla ɖaŋsieyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Worokoyǝ láa nyɩŋ enyipǝ pǝ ri enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ saŋ rǝ kǝ́ pǝ la lɔ Yesu Kǝriso pǝ lo nuŋ kǝto. Lée yee wǝ mǝ ŋ koonu epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la lɔ Kǝriso pǝ lo nuŋ wǝ, duturǝ ɖi wǝsǝpǝkpǝ rɛ wǝ lee kpii rǝ pǝlǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ le yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ, pǝ lǝŋ koru anya Worokoyǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Paape Worokoyǝ le yee pǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ la cɛɛ, lǝ fǝ pǝ le yee enyikʊʊpǝ saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso, yǝ we ŋ náa pɔrʊ pǝ rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ Kǝriso le yee otoolukǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ na ŋpǝrayǝ ŋ ne sii epǝ we pǝ la lɔ ŋwǝ Kǝriso pǝ lo nuŋ lo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, Worokoyǝ la pɔrʊ la kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋwǝ ŋ kʊʊ mǝ kǝ́ ŋ cà enimiyǝ ŋ sìi rǝ loh oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ we le yeli eniyǝ nɔ rǝ <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />na lɛtaarǝwǝ we le eniyǝ wǝ. Ruŋruŋ le jirǝ sa we, Worokoyǝ tǝ ya láa pɔrʊ mǝ ŋ kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋwǝ ŋ kʊʊ, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ epǝ we pǝ la lɔ Yesu pǝ lo nuŋ mǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Kǝ́ lo tu kǝto wǝ́ yǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ la ya la mǝ rɛɛrɩ mǝ lah wɛ wǝ? Ow, tǝrɛ wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ kpii! Kǝ́ kǝto? Kpiikǝ tuwǝ wǝ lǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ wǝ kaamǝ lɔnuŋrǝ. Wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ ri e yee a saŋ rǝ tuwǝ Mose le seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Awo, yǝ láa nyɩŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ nyiyǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ kǝ́ yǝ we ŋ na lɔ Kǝriso ŋ no nuŋ kǝto, ŋkǝ rǝ kǝ́ yǝ we ŋ née yee mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />We amaa Worokoyǝ ri rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ ceŋceŋ lo Worokoyǝ? Lee ri enyituturupǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ lo Worokoyǝ? Ǝŋkǝ́, ri enyituturupǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ lo Worokoyǝ, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />kpiikǝ Worokoyǝ ceŋceŋ ko ŋ kpii. Ŋwǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ Oyudatǝpǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ pǝla lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto, ŋwǝ ke ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ pǝla lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />We vǝ́ yǝ la lɔ yǝ lo nuŋ wǝǝ wǝlo duturǝ ɖi Mose le seyǝ lǝǝ tǝ ŋ ri tǝrɛ mǝ lǝ? Kʊrakʊra! Paa la ya yǝ láa pɔrʊ no okurupoŋpiyǝ yǝ ŋ kaŋ rǝ.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Abǝrahamǝ la anyɩŋcamǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Rǝkǝsa wǝǝ, kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ lo ru rǝ lǝh tǝtǝ Abǝrahamǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ? Kǝ́ wǝ́ ŋ nyà mǝŋ nyɩmaasɩyǝ kǝtǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Mǝŋ Worokoyǝ nyɩnɩ Abǝrahamǝ cìi ǝkǝnǝŋ ri nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ na anǝnɛyeeyǝ we, ka ka ŋ rɛɛrɩ mǝ na wɛ. Paa lǝŋ koru wǝ le eyee rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Abǝrahamǝ tɛ̀ɛ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ yeli nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto.» <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mǝŋ rɛ ya lée yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ we, pǝ láa mwara ŋwǝ rǝ. Wǝ́ no wǝtoorikpǝ sa we, wǝ lee ri tucɛɛwǝ, paa wǝ ri wǝtookpǝ pǝ la mwara ŋwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Paa mǝŋ rɛ lee yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ rɛ, wǝ́ paa ŋ na lɔ Worokoyǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ turɔɔrɔɔyeetǝyǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ ŋ no nuŋ we, Worokoyǝ láa yɩrɩ rǝ nyiyǝ sa la lɔnuŋrǝ ŋ fǝ ŋwǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Davidǝ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ tɛnɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ, nyiyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ naa yɩrɩ rǝ na anǝnɛyǝ wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ ŋwǝ ŋ ne yee nyikʊʊyǝ we, yǝ we lo co yǝ:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ pǝlo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ na cɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">wǝ́ ŋ na siɛ pǝlǝ yǝ we, pǝ lo co yǝ!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Nyiyǝ we Ǝtǝ Woroko ŋ nǝŋ yɩrɩ no oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ we, yǝ we lo co yǝ!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kǝto wǝsiɛrɩkpǝ sa wǝǝ, wǝ kpii wǝ koonu Oyudatǝpǝ ceŋceŋ? Amaa wǝ kpii wǝ koonu mǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ? Yǝ la tɛŋ wǝ yǝ la pa tɛlɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokoyǝ fǝ̀ Abǝrahamǝ yeli nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto». <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Eniyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ tuwǝ sa wǝ pǝlǝ wǝ? Kǝ́ pǝ lǝ kǝǝlǝ Abǝrahamǝ la kǝmaa amaa kpɛŋ kǝ pǝ pǝ kǝǝlǝ ŋwǝ? Ow, ŋkǝ wǝla kǝmaa, paa kpɛŋ kǝ pǝ pǝ kǝǝlǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Kpɛŋ kǝ Abǝrahamǝ ŋ pǝ kǝǝlǝ we, ke ri nyikʊʊyǝ kaka, duturǝ ɖi lɔ̀ Worokoyǝ nunu. Wǝla kǝmaakǝ wǝ́ pǝ kǝ̀ǝlǝ ŋwǝ. Ǝkǝǝlǝkǝ sa kǝ ri barǝ ga ŋ kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ ŋwǝ le yee nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto. Mǝŋkǝsa we, Abǝrahamǝ la siɛrɩ le yee epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la lɔ Worokoyǝ pǝ lo nuŋ lǝ tǝyǝ mǝŋkǝ́ pǝ lǝǝ kǝǝlǝ wǝ. Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ pǝ le yee enyikʊʊpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Abǝrahamǝ tǝ lɛ ri epǝ we pǝ lǝ kǝǝlǝ lǝ tǝyǝ. Ŋkǝ epǝ we pǝ la nya pǝ lǝ kǝǝlǝ rǝ ko. Paa pǝ la lɛ pǝ le siimǝ lǝh tǝ Abǝrahamǝ la lɔnuŋrǝ le wǝniekpǝ wǝ. Ŋwǝ paa lɔ̀ Worokoyǝ nunu kpɛŋ wǝ́ ŋ cìi ǝkǝ̀ǝlǝ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ lo co tǝrɛ la garǝ lo koonu epǝ we pǝ la lɔ pǝ lo nuŋ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Worokoyǝ cò Abǝrahamǝ mǝ nǝ wǝmǝkpǝ la garǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ ŋ koonu pǝ mǝŋ tǝtuwǝ. Ŋkǝ kǝ́ Abǝrahamǝ ŋ yeli ŋ sanǝ rǝ tuwǝ seyǝ ŋ na tɛŋ kǝto wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ cò na garǝ sa. Paa cò Abǝrahamǝ la garǝ sa kpiikǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ yeli nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Mǝŋ o ko turu epǝ we pǝ le yee pǝ la saŋ rǝ seyǝ lo tuwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ, ŋpǝ ceŋceŋ pǝ lah pa lɔ otuceeceeyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ cò garǝ we, we lɔnuŋrǝ gah siɛrɩ yee tukpaakpaawǝ, eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ la kacowǝ sa wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ lǝmǝ duturǝ! <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Mǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ cii Mose le seyǝ wǝ́ paa pǝ lǝŋ yee pǝ saŋ rǝ ŋwǝ we, Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ. Paa fɛɛwǝ seyǝ ŋ nee kpii we, rɛ lǝŋ lɛ ŋ tɔɔ seyǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ŋ wǝ kǝto, saŋ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ wǝ́ yǝ láa lɔ tuwǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ no co garǝ wǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ wǝ ri tuwǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ no koonu ŋ na cɛɛ wǝ. Kacowǝ sa we, wǝ kpii wǝ koonu Abǝrahamǝ lǝ wǝmǝkpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ. Wǝ lee kpii wǝ koonu epǝ we ceŋceŋ pǝ lée yee pǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ, paa wǝ kpii wǝ koonu epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ la lɔ pǝ lo nuŋ mǝŋ kǝ́ Abǝrahamǝ ŋ lɔ̀ ŋ nunu kǝtǝ wǝ. Abǝrahamǝ ŋ ri loh kpǝlo lǝ tǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ nǝ fǝ lǝ́ ŋ́ ne yee wǝkpǝŋmumuŋkpǝ rɛ lǝ tǝtǝyǝ.» Abǝrahamǝ ri lǝh tǝyǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ we ŋ na lɔ ŋ no nuŋ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. Worokoyǝ we ŋ náa saanǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ wǝ́ ŋ ri, ŋwǝ ŋ nóo pwo otuyǝ we yǝ lee kpii rǝ ǝrǝkǝ mǝ ŋ pǝ ǝrǝkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Kpɛɛtɛɛwǝ wǝ lǝǝ kǝ tǝ wǝ kpii wǝ koonu Abǝrahamǝ, paape wǝ́ ŋ nyɩ̀ɩ ŋ tɛ̀ɛ kpɛɛwǝ. Lɔ̀ Worokoyǝ nunu, ŋ wǝ kǝto wǝ́ ŋ ne yee «Wǝkpǝŋmumuŋkpǝ rɛ lǝ tǝtǝyǝ», mǝŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ tìi nǝ wǝ kǝtǝ, ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ lǝ́ wǝmǝkpǝ wǝ lah pa naanǝ kpǝŋwǝ wǝǝ». <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">1Mo 15:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Abǝrahamǝ lah mǝ lɔ mǝŋ cɛŋwǝ tuuru. Mǝŋkǝ́ ŋ ke cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ no kuru ŋ nah ta ŋ kpǝ́ wǝ́ ne tie Sara ŋ nǝǝ kǝ ŋ mǝ paape we, na lɔnuŋrǝ laa yɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">1Mo 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 17:15-22">15-22</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Lǝǝ tǝmǝlǝ wǝ́ ŋ naa lɛ ŋ pɔrʊ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la garǝ we ŋ cò ŋwǝ wǝ. Paa wǝ́ na lɔnuŋrǝ gbìi no okopiyǝ wǝ́ ŋ kǝ ŋ kǝ Worokoyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Tɛ̀ɛ kpɛɛwǝ fee ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ ŋ née yee tuwǝ we ŋ no co garǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Wǝ kǝto pǝ la tɛŋ pǝ lo ru rǝ Abǝrahamǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ na lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto wǝ́ «Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ̀ ŋwǝ ŋ yeli nyikʊʊyǝ»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">1Mo 15:6</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Paape dierǝ sa pǝ la ŋʊrʊ ǝkǝnǝŋ «Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ ŋwǝ le yee nyikʊʊyǝ» we, pǝ laa ŋʊrʊ rǝ pǝ koonu Abǝrahamǝ ceŋceŋ. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Pǝ ŋʊ̀rʊ rǝ pǝ kòonu ŋla ŋkpɛ. Ŋlǝ epǝ we wǝ kaamǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ wǝ. Kpiikǝ yǝ la lɔ Worokoyǝ we ŋ sàanǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu ŋ rù rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ yǝ lo nuŋ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Pǝ fǝ̀ Yesu pǝ kpìi enyipǝ rǝ akaakǝ wǝ́ pǝ wʊlʊ ŋwǝ rǝ loh oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ kǝto. Paape Worokoyǝ la saanǝ ŋwǝ lo ru rǝ gbɛŋrǝ, kǝ ŋ fǝ lǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu la ca lǝ le kpii rǝ awɛ ŋlǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Rǝkǝsa, kǝ́ wǝ ri Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ lǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ lah lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto we, wǝ́ wǝtaarǝkpǝ wǝ lǝ pǝ ŋlǝ mǝ ŋwǝ lǝ mǝrǝ saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kǝ́ yǝ la lɔ Yesu Kǝriso yǝ lo nuŋ kǝto wǝ́ gʊŋrǝ la kpɛɛ lo koonu lǝ la nya Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ. Ŋ wǝ lɛsiɛrɩwǝ sa mǝrǝ wǝ́ yǝ la tɔ la yaa, wǝ́ la ya yǝ láa nya faawǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ yǝ lah pa kʊla rǝ Worokoyǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ we mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Wǝ́ ŋkǝ wǝ ǝnǝ ceŋceŋ, lǝ tǝ la ya yǝ láa nya faawǝ rǝ lah acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ mǝrǝ. Duturǝ ɖi le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ yǝ lóo koonu atɔyaakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Vǝ́ mǝŋ nyiyǝ rɛ láa nyɩɩ mǝ ŋ tɔ mǝ ŋ yaa we, yǝ we láa tɔ mǝ ŋ yaa rǝ gbaraarǝ mǝrǝ. Yǝ we ŋ náa tɔ mǝ ŋ yaa we, láa tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Wǝ́ kpɛɛtɛɛwǝ sa we, wǝ lǝŋ tǝǝnǝ nyiyǝ, duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ nǝ kǝǝtaawǝ lǝ lǝǝrǝ lah asiɔŋyǝ saŋ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ we ŋ no koonu lǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Awo, eniyǝ we lǝ kǝ tǝ le kpii yǝ lǝǝ kǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ we, wǝ́ Kǝriso ŋ kpǝ̀ ŋ kòonu oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ mǝ eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ tǝ̀nǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Wǝ láa lɛnyɩ kǝ rɛ ŋ tɛɛnɩ ŋ kpǝ́ rǝ nyikʊʊyǝ lo yuwǝ! Ayɩrɛ rɛ láa ca turuwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋwǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ rǝ nyiyǝ ŋ née yee eceeceeyǝ lo yuwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Paa Worokoyǝ la pɔrʊ la kaŋ lǝ kǝ́ ŋ náa taa lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ saŋ eni: Mǝŋkǝ́ lǝ kǝ tǝ le ri oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ paape we, Kǝriso kpǝ̀ rǝ loh yuwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Wǝ́ kǝ́ wǝ ri ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ lǝ le yee enyikʊʊpǝ saŋ rǝ Kǝriso la ŋpǝrayǝ we, kǝ ŋ wɛɛ lǝŋ pɔrʊ lǝ ŋ ru rǝ Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ? <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Duturǝ ɖi le ke ri Worokoyǝ lǝ ǝkǝǝkpǝlǝtǝpǝ, paape Worokoyǝ la pa ca lǝ le kpii mǝ na wɛ saŋ rǝ ne Pi la gbɛŋrǝ. Kǝ́ wǝ ri ŋ na ca lǝ ŋ ne kpii mǝ na wɛ we, Worokoyǝ láa lɔ ŋ koonu lǝ kpiikǝ ne Pi ŋ kpii vɔrʊrǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Wǝ faa lɛ, la ya yǝ láa nya faawǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso, ŋwǝ yǝ we rǝkǝsa ŋ na ca lǝ ŋ ne kpii rǝ awɛ ŋlǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wǝsǝpǝkpǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ Adamǝ mǝ Kǝriso mǝrǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ la saŋ rǝ nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ lo oŋuŋkǝ wǝ le fii ǝrǝkǝ, wǝ́ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lǝ pǝ mǝ gbɛŋrǝ. Wǝ́ gbɛŋrǝ lo tuu enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kpiikǝ pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ le yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Kpɛŋ kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ pǝ fǝ seyǝ ŋ koonu Mose we, turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ ka marǝ wǝ kpìi rǝ ǝrǝkǝ. Paape kǝ́ seyǝ ŋ naa ka maa ŋ kpii kǝto we, Worokoyǝ lǝǝ kǝ ŋ kǝ nyiyǝ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝ ŋ tǝnǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Paape fǝ ǝrǝ Adamǝ le diirǝ po ru Mose le diirǝ we, gbɛŋrǝ ga ŋ wʊʊlʊ enyipǝ mǝŋ epǝ we pǝ lee yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝŋ Adamǝ la nɛŋwǝ kǝtǝ wǝ. Adamǝ lee yee ŋ saŋ rǝ Worokoyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ. Adamǝ ke ri yǝ we ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ ŋ pǝ pǝ la cɛrɛcɛrɛyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Paape wǝsǝpǝmumuŋkpǝ rɛ wǝ kpii rǝ Worokoyǝ lo tuwǝ we ŋ no koonu ŋ na cɛɛ mǝ Adamǝ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we mǝrǝ. Awo, enyipǝ wa pǝ lǝ kpǝ́ rǝ nyiyǝ sa ceŋceŋ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝto. Paa Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ sa ŋ ne yee enyipǝ wa saŋ rǝ nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ kaamǝ Yesu Kǝriso we, wǝ lo ru okuruyǝ ŋpa wǝ le teeri. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Worokoyǝ lo tuwǝ we ŋ no koonu ŋ na cɛɛ lo tuwǝ wǝ lée yee we, wǝ la cɛkɛlɛ mǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ ceŋceŋ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ. Duturǝ ɖi nyiyǝ we ceŋceŋyǝ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ tɛnɩ wǝkpaŋkpǝ we, wǝ lǝ pǝ mǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ la bɔtɔɔrǝ wǝ. Paa Worokoyǝ lo tuwǝ sa ŋ no koonu ŋ na cɛɛ we, wǝ lo koonu wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ mǝŋkǝ́ pǝ le yee oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋpa paape. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kǝceece, saŋ rǝ nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝto wǝ́ gbɛŋrǝ le ri wǝpilikpǝ rǝ enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ lo oŋuŋkǝ wǝ. Paa saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso ceŋceŋ we, anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ la lɔ otuyǝ ŋpa rǝ Worokoyǝ pǝ le teeri. Epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ láa lɔ Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩmumuŋwǝ sa mǝ na alɔkuŋkǝ la kǝnǝnɛkǝ lo tukoonuwǝ sa we, pǝ leh ke tii vɔrʊrǝ kǝ pǝ ri wǝpilikpǝ pǝ kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kǝto we, nyɩmaasɩyǝ ceŋceŋ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lo koonu enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ la bɔtɔɔrǝ wǝ. Kaa wǝ nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ la kǝnǝnɛkʊʊkǝ ŋ ne yee we, kǝ lo koonu wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ na siɛrɩ anyɩmaasɩpǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ kǝ pǝ tii vɔrʊrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ noo co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ, wǝ lo koonu wǝ́ enyipǝ wa pǝ le yee oturɔɔrɔɔyeetǝpǝ. Kaa wǝǝ saŋ rǝ nyiyǝ ceŋceŋ lo kǝtukoŋcokǝ we, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ enyipǝ wa ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ ne enimiyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Kǝ́ Mose le seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ we, wǝ́ oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ yǝ la naanǝ. Paape fɛɛwǝ we oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ yǝ la naanǝ we, Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ lǝ tǝ wǝ la naanǝ ŋpa wǝ la kʊla rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Eniyǝ nɔ we, turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ kǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ wǝ koonu gbɛŋrǝ. Kaa wǝǝ rǝkǝsa we, Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ wǝ fǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ wǝ yee enyikʊʊpǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, yǝ láa nya vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Epǝ we pǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Yesu we, pǝ lǝǝmǝ vɔrʊrǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Rǝkǝsa kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ? Yǝ lée re le mǝ yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ rǝ ko kǝ Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ tǝ wǝ ŋ naanǝ wǝ ŋ kʊla? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Kʊrakʊra! Rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ we, lǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ yǝ lǝ kpǝ́. Wǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ lǝ tǝ lo koru etii vɔrʊrǝ rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lǝ mǝrǝ? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Nǝ nyee ci wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ le wiiri worokomɛŋwǝ kǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Yesu Kǝriso we, pǝ le wiiri lǝ wǝ kǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ ŋwǝ rǝ na gbɛŋrǝ sa rǝ? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Kǝto kǝ́ pǝ le wiiri lǝ worokomɛŋwǝ sa we, wǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ pǝ la ŋwaa lǝ pǝ la kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ kǝ́ yǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ na gbɛŋrǝ sa wǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, mǝŋ kǝ́ Yesu ŋ na saanǝ ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ saŋ rǝ Tǝyǝ lo okopimumuŋyǝ we yǝ teeri tu ri ŋ tu we, kǝ ŋla ŋkpɛ le tii vɔrʊŋwɛŋrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ yǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ ŋwǝ saŋ rǝ gbɛŋrǝ rɛ lo ru na nɛŋrǝ we, kǝ́ yǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ le pe yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ ŋwǝ saŋ rǝ kǝ́ yǝ láa saanǝ yǝ lo ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ mǝŋ ŋwǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Le cii tuwǝ sa sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ, pǝ la kpaa lǝh wǝlǝkuukuukpǝ we pǝ la maarǝ rǝ kpɛtɛkpǝlɛciiwǝ pǝ la kʊla mǝ Kǝriso kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ nǝǝnǝ lǝh wǝlǝkuukuukpǝ sa wǝ ka ranǝ mǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ le eyeekǝ wǝ, kǝ lǝ pǝǝ tǝ le ri arɔŋpǝ lo koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Duturǝ ɖi yǝ we ŋ nǝ kpǝ́ we, lo ru rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la akaakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ yǝ lǝ kpǝ́ yǝ la kʊla mǝ Kǝriso we, yǝ la lɔ yǝ lo nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ yǝ lǝh pǝ tǝ le tii vɔrʊrǝ la kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Le cii wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ ǝrǝ kǝ́ Kǝriso ŋ na saanǝ ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, lǝŋ tǝ ŋ pǝ kpǝ́, gbɛŋrǝ lǝǝ tǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ no oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Kǝriso lǝ kpǝ́, lǝ kpǝ́ lo koonu enyipǝ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝceŋceŋ ko wǝ la lɛ kǝkpakǝkpa. Rǝkǝsa kpii vɔrʊrǝ, wǝ́ ŋ kpii vɔrʊrǝ ŋ koonu Worokoyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Kaa wǝ ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ we, nǝ nyɩŋ nǝ wɛ mǝŋ nǝ nyǝ kpǝ́ nǝ nyo koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ, wǝ́ nǝ kpii vɔrʊrǝ nǝ koonu Worokoyǝ mǝ kǝ́ nǝ nye yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Yesu Kǝriso wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ kpii kǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ nya okopiyǝ rǝ nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ sa lǝh pǝ kpǝ́ jirǝ rɛ wǝ. Wǝ́ wǝ lee kpii kǝ nǝ tǝ nǝ nyarǝ nǝ wɛ nǝ co nǝ koonu nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ sa. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Nǝ pǝǝ tǝ nǝ fǝ nǝ okpuŋtuyǝ nǝ koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝŋ anǝnɛtuyǝ kǝ yǝ ŋ yee rɔɔrɔɔwǝ. Paa we, nǝ fǝ nǝ wɛ nǝ koonu Worokoyǝ bomu. Kǝ́ nǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ la saanǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ gbɛŋrǝ mǝrǝ we, nǝ nyarǝ nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ nǝ co nǝ koonu ŋwǝ mǝŋ nǝnɛtuwǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ ŋ yee tuwǝ wǝ kʊʊ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Duturǝ ɖi turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ nǝ oŋuŋkǝ, kpiikǝ nǝ nyǝǝ tǝ nǝ kpii rǝ Mose le seyǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ, paa nǝ kpii rǝ Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Le ri arɔŋpǝ lo koonu wǝkʊʊkpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Kǝto le reemǝ nɛ? Kpawǝ we yǝ lǝǝ tǝ le kpii rǝ Mose le seyǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ, wǝ́ paa le kpii rǝ Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ kǝto yǝ lée mǝ yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ? Kʊrakʊra! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Nǝ cii wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ mǝŋ nǝ nya nyarǝ nǝ wɛ nǝ nyo co nǝ nyo koonu nyiyǝ rɛ wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee nǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ we, oturu nǝ nya siɛrɩ nǝ nye yee arɔŋpǝ nǝ nyo koonu nyiyǝ sa lǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee wǝ. Kǝto, amaa nǝ ri arɔŋpǝ nǝ koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lée re nyiyǝ wǝ ŋ ko gbɛŋrǝ wǝ, amaa nǝ ri Worokoyǝ la asʊmatǝpǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ nǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ kpiikǝ nǝ nyée yee nǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Worokoyǝ le yeekǝ! Ŋnǝ ǝpǝ ǝnǝ eniyǝ nɔ nǝ ke ri arɔŋpǝ nǝ kòonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, nǝ nyǝ fǝ nǝ ziɔŋrǝ fee nǝ nye yee nǝ nya saŋ rǝ otukaŋyǝ we nǝ nya lɔ wǝ <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Pǝ la pɔrʊ nǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la akaakǝ, wǝ́ nǝ ya nǝ nyée yee tuwǝ wǝ kʊʊ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa wɛɛlɩ mǝŋ kǝ́ anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ láa wɛɛlɩ kǝtǝ, kpiikǝ nǝ nyǝŋ koru onuŋ otuyǝ lo duturǝ kǝto. Eniyǝ nɔ we, nǝ kǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ arɔŋpǝ kǝtǝ, nǝ nyàrǝ nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo okpuŋtuyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ nǝ cò nǝ kòonu apɔlɔpɔtǝtuyǝ mǝ kǝtʊkpaakǝ le eyeekǝ. Ŋ wǝ tuwǝ sa wǝ lo koonu wǝ́ nǝ nye yi nǝ nya tɛɛ rǝ Worokoyǝ wǝ. Kaa wǝǝ rǝkǝsa we, mǝŋ arɔŋpǝ kǝtǝ we, nǝ nyarǝ nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo okpuŋtuyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ nǝ co nǝ koonu tuwǝ wǝ kʊʊ le eyeekǝ, kǝ nǝ tii vɔrʊrǝ láa ca Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Eniyǝ we nǝ ke ri arɔŋpǝ nǝ kòonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, wǝkʊʊkpǝ wǝ lǝǝ kǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ nǝ oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Vasʊyǝ rǝ fǝŋ wǝ́ nǝ nyà nǝ rù rǝ otuyǝ sa nǝ ke ŋ yee wǝ? Rǝkǝsa yǝ ya yǝ lóo co nǝ nʊŋsɔɔwǝ. Ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa le eyeekǝ we, yǝ lóo ko mǝ nyiyǝ rǝ gbɛŋrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Paa rǝkǝsa we, pǝ la pɔrʊ nǝ pǝ lo ru rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la akaakǝ, wǝ́ nǝ nya siɛrɩ nǝ nye yee Worokoyǝ la arɔŋpǝ. Nǝ vasʊyǝ ŋ kaamǝ nǝ vɔrʊrǝ sa nǝ nyǝ fǝ nǝ nyo koonu ŋwǝ fee wǝ. Rǝ kǝtǝǝlǝkǝ we, nǝ nyáa nya vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Duturǝ ɖi turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lo wǝtoomwarakpǝ we, wǝ kaamǝ gbɛŋrǝ. Paa Worokoyǝ lo tuwǝ ŋ nóo koonu mǝ ŋ cɛɛ we, wǝ kaamǝ vɔrʊlaalɛɛrǝ kpiikǝ yǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso kǝto.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Kǝrisotǝpiyǝ lo ru rǝ seyǝ la akaakǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, ŋ́ cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ nǝ marǝ nǝ cii tuwǝ we ŋ neh tíi nǝ kaka, duturǝ ɖi nǝ cii Mose le seyǝ. Mǝŋ nyɩmaasɩyǝ nya kpii vɔrʊrǝ rǝ ko we, seyǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ no oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kǝ lǝ fǝ tunyɩŋcamǝwǝ sa, ǝkǝnǝŋ tieyǝ ŋ na caa wǝnuŋkpǝ we, seyǝ la parǝ ŋwǝ la maarǝ mǝ no nuŋyǝ mǝŋ pǝrǝŋyǝ sa nya kpii vɔrʊrǝ rǝ ko. Paa mǝŋ no nuŋyǝ sa lǝ kpǝ́ we, o lóo turu tieyǝ sa lo ru rǝ seyǝ we ŋ pàrǝ ŋwǝ ŋ màarǝ mǝ no nuŋyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kǝto mǝŋ la siɛrɩ le yee pǝrǝŋpʊŋpwayǝ rɛ le tieyǝ rǝ kǝ́ no nuŋyǝ ŋ tǝ ŋ kpii vɔrʊrǝ we, pǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ tieyǝ sa ri rǝ fuuyɩɩtǝyǝ. Paa mǝŋ no nuŋyǝ lǝ kpǝ́ we, tieyǝ sa lo ru rǝ seyǝ sa la akaakǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, lóo koru asiɛrɩ ŋ yee pʊŋpwayǝ rɛ le tieyǝ, pǝ lǝŋ tǝ pǝ pwo ŋwǝ fuuyɩɩtǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, kǝ́ wǝ lǝ wǝ koonu ŋnǝ ŋkpɛ wǝǝ! Ko rǝ seyǝ lǝ kpǝŋ we, nǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ lǝ kpǝ́, kpiikǝ nǝ nye yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Kǝriso ŋ kpǝ̀ wǝ, kǝto nǝ nyǝ sǝrǝ mǝ seyǝ kɩɩkɩ. Rǝkǝsa we, nǝ ri nyipʊŋpwayǝ rɛ la anɛŋ, yǝ we ŋ na saanǝ ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ wǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ la nya fɛɛ le mǝ yee anǝnɛyǝ lo koonu Worokoyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Awo, kǝ́ eniyǝ nɔ lǝ tǝ le ke ŋ re vɔrʊrǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ ŋlǝŋlǝ lǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ we, seyǝ ŋ ka ŋ saanǝ loh otucakpɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ we yǝ ŋ yee anǝnɛyǝ rǝ lah wɛlɛŋrǝ, wǝ́ le ke ŋ yee otuyǝ yǝ lóo koonu lǝ gbɛŋrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Paa rǝkǝsa we yǝ lo ru rǝ seyǝ la akaakǝ. Ko rǝ tuwǝ we wǝ lɔ̀ lǝ wǝ tanǝ wǝ tǝ̀nǝ lǝ kpǝŋ we, lǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ lǝ kpǝ́. Kǝto yǝ lóo koru asʊma Worokoyǝ saŋ rǝ wǝlǝŋwɛŋkpǝ rɛ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lo koonu lǝ wǝ, ŋkǝ rǝ wǝlǝkuukuukpǝ we Mose le seyǝ ŋ ŋʊ̀rʊ ŋ kòonu lǝ wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seyǝ ŋ nóo koonu wǝ́ nyiyǝ ŋ née yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ rǝkǝsa? Kǝto seyǝ ri turɔɔrɔɔwǝ? Kʊrakʊra! Rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ wǝ lo koonu mǝ ŋ́ ne ci tuwǝ wǝ ri turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ seyǝ laa ka tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ «Paa mwɛɛrɩ tǝrɛ le nimirǝ» we, ŋ́ nǝŋ ke ci tuwǝ wǝ ri nimimwɛɛrɩwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ la cɛ wǝ la tɛɛ rǝ seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ, wǝ́ wǝ la nya gʊŋrǝ wǝ la saanǝ otucakpɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ rǝ mǝ mǝrǝ. Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ seyǝ lee ke kpii we, turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lǝŋ ke kpii. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Eniyǝ nɔ we, kǝ́ seyǝ ŋ nee ke kpii we, ŋ́ ke kpii vɔrʊrǝ. Paa kǝ́ seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ pǝ we, wǝ́ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ la saanǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Wǝ́ ŋmǝ paa ŋ́ nǝ kpǝ́. Seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ sa wǝ koh koonu ŋmǝ ŋ́ tii vɔrʊrǝ we, ŋ wǝ wǝ loh koonu ŋmǝ ŋ́ kpǝ́ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Duturǝ ɖi turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ la cɛ wǝ la tɛɛ rǝ seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ wǝ́ wǝ lǝ tǝǝnǝ mǝ, wǝ́ wǝ lǝ fǝ seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ sa wǝ la wʊ mǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Kǝto we, Mose le seyǝ lǝ kenikeni, no tutɛŋwǝ wǝ lǝ kenikeni, wǝ kʊʊ wǝ́ wǝ ponu. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />We kǝto seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ sa wǝ ponu rǝ, wǝ la siɛrɩ wǝ le yee tuwǝ wǝ lah wʊ mǝ? Kʊrakʊra! Paa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ láa wʊ nyiyǝ wǝ. Turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lǝ fǝ tuwǝ wǝ ponu wǝ lo koonu mǝ gbɛŋrǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, seyǝ lo tutɛŋwǝ wǝ lo koonu kǝ enyipǝ pǝ nyɩŋ kǝ́ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lɛnyɩ wǝ fǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Mose le seyǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Ŋmǝ paa we, ŋ́ ri rǝ nyɩmaasɩfɔlɔfɔtǝyǝ, pǝ le siiri mǝ mǝŋ rɔŋyǝ pǝ lo koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Kǝceece we, ŋ́ naa ya ŋ́ nóo nuŋ tuwǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee lo duturǝ. Tuwǝ we ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee we, ŋ́ nǝŋ yee wǝ, wǝ́ paa tuwǝ we ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ kpǝlǝ kǝǝwǝ we, ŋ wǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ née yee wǝ! <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ tuwǝ we ŋ́ nǝŋ taa wǝ́ ŋ́ née yee we, we ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa nyɩŋ mǝ ŋ ci ǝkǝnǝŋ Mose le seyǝ ponu. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />We ŋkǝ ŋmǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee tǝrɛ, paa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ mǝ mǝrǝ wǝ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋ́ cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tuceeceewǝ rɛ wǝ lee kpii rǝ mǝ mǝrǝ, ŋ́ reemǝ rǝ mǝ ziɔŋrǝ mǝrǝ. Wǝ ponu mǝ mǝ kǝ ŋ́ yee tuceeceewǝ paape ŋ́ nǝŋ koru wǝ le eyeekǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Tuceeceewǝ we ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee we, ŋ́ nǝŋ yee wǝ, paa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we ŋ́ nǝŋ taa we, ŋ wǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ née yee wǝ! <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Mǝŋ tuwǝ we ŋ́ nǝŋ taa eyeekǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee we, we wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ ri ŋmǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee wǝ, paa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ mǝ wǝ lǝǝwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Mǝŋkǝsa we, ŋ́ no ko ru rǝ wǝlǝkpǝ rɛ wǝ kpii rǝ mǝ wǝ. Vǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee tuceeceewǝ we, turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ mǝ mǝrǝ wǝ lée yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Rǝ mǝ ziɔŋrǝ we, Worokoyǝ le seyǝ ponu mǝ mǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Paa ŋ́ náa nyɩŋ sepʊŋpwayǝ rɛ kpii rǝ mǝ okpuŋtuyǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ya ŋ née yee akɔŋkǝ mǝ yǝ ǝnǝ mǝ otuciyǝ yǝ la tɛɛ akaakǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ mǝ ŋ ne yee rɔŋyǝ ŋ no koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ le seyǝ we ŋ kpii rǝ mǝ okpuŋtuyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mǝ paapɔ mǝ mǝ aria! Ǝlǝ ŋ nah pɔrʊ mǝ ŋ ru rǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ sa ɖe mǝ lóo ko rǝ gbɛŋrǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ŋ́ née ceeni Worokoyǝ, ŋwǝ ŋ nah pa pɔrʊ mǝ ŋ ru saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso wǝ! Kǝto ŋmǝŋmǝ rǝ mǝ oyupuyǝ we, ŋ́ ne yee rɔŋyǝ ŋ́ no koonu Worokoyǝ le seyǝ, paa rǝ mǝ wǝlǝkpǝ mǝrǝ we, ŋ́ ri rɔŋyǝ ŋ́ koonu turɔɔrɔɔwǝ le seyǝ.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Vɔrʊrǝ we Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lóo koonu enyipǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Rǝkǝsa we, epǝ we pǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Kǝriso we, pǝ lǝǝ tǝ pǝ lǝmǝ bɔtɔɔrǝ rɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ le seyǝ we ŋ nóo koonu vɔrʊrǝ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso mǝrǝ we, la pɔrʊ mǝ rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ mǝ gbɛŋrǝ le seyǝ la akaakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ŋ wǝ tuwǝ sa wǝ́ Mose le seyǝ we ŋ noo ko ŋ koru eyee wǝ, kpiikǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ lǝ wǝlǝkpǝ wǝ kǝ ŋ sǝŋ kʊŋwǝ wǝ ŋ koonu seyǝ sa la kǝnǝnɛkǝ. Paa Worokoyǝ le yee wǝ. Le kpii ne Pi la maŋ mǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo ru nyɩmaasɩyǝ ŋ née yee oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ la wɛlɛŋrǝ wǝ, kǝ ŋ pa nya fɛɛ ŋ pɔrʊ anyɩmaasɩpǝ rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la akaakǝ. Saŋ rǝ tuwǝ sa we, Worokoyǝ la tɔɔ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ sa wǝ ya wǝ lée yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ rǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ la bɔrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Worokoyǝ le yee wǝ ǝnǝ kǝ lo koru etii vɔrʊrǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ Mose le seyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ wǝ wǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, yǝ lée tii vɔrʊrǝ saŋ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ. Yǝ lǝŋ tǝ le tii vɔrʊrǝ saŋ rǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Duturǝ ɖi epǝ we pǝ lée tii vɔrʊrǝ pǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ pǝla wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ we, pǝ lée yee wɛlɛŋrǝ sa lo otucakpɛɛyǝ. Paa epǝ we pǝ lée tii vɔrʊrǝ saŋ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ we, pǝ lée yee rǝ otuyǝ we Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Mǝŋ rɛ siimǝ rǝ na wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ láa tɛlɩ we, lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́. Paa mǝŋ rɛ siimǝ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ we, Worokoyǝ lóo koonu na vɔrʊrǝ mǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Epǝ we pǝ siimǝ rǝ pǝla wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ we, pǝ ri Worokoyǝ lǝ ǝkǝǝkpǝlǝtǝpǝ. Pǝ lǝŋ yee pǝ saŋ rǝ Worokoyǝ le seyǝ, wǝ́ pǝ lǝŋ ce pǝ koru seyǝ sa le eyee. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Epǝ we pǝ siimǝ rǝ pǝla wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ we, pǝlo tuwǝ wǝ lǝŋ koru aca Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ŋnǝ paa we, nǝ nyee siimǝ rǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ sa, nǝ siimǝ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ kpiikǝ Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ gbii rǝ nǝ kǝto. Mǝŋ rɛ lǝǝ lǝmǝ Kǝriso la Wɛɛrǝ we, yǝ we lee ri Kǝriso la nɛŋyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Kǝriso kpii rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ, paape rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ kǝto we, nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ sa lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́. Paape kpiikǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ nǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ kǝto we, Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lóo koonu nǝ vɔrʊrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Mǝŋ Worokoyǝ we ŋ na saanǝ Yesu ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ la Wɛɛrǝ gbii rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ we, we ŋwǝ Worokoyǝ sa ŋ na saanǝ Kǝriso ŋ no ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ lo koonu nǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ sa lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ la vɔrʊrǝ saŋ rǝ na Wɛɛrǝ sa gbii rǝ nǝ mǝrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kǝto we, lǝh ǝtǝŋ, le re wǝtookpǝ rɛ. Paa yǝ lee re lah wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ lo wǝtookpǝ rɛ. Kǝto wǝ lee kpii kǝ le tii vɔrʊrǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ wɛlɛŋrǝ lo otucakpɛɛyǝ sa yǝ lǝ pǝ́ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Mǝŋ nǝ nyée tii vɔrʊrǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ ŋyǝ otucakpɛɛyǝ sa yǝ lǝ pǝ́ we, nǝ nyǝ́ǝ kpǝ́. Paa mǝŋ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lo toŋ nǝ nǝ nyǝ nǝǝnǝ nǝ wǝlǝrɔɔrɔɔkpǝ kɩɩkɩ we, nǝ nyée tii vɔrʊrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Kpiikǝ enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ Worokoyǝ la wɛɛrǝ lée re we, pǝ ri Worokoyǝ le epipǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Wɛɛrǝ sa nǝ nya lɔ we, lee ri wɛɛrǝ rɛ lǝ́ǝ fǝ nǝ yee arɔŋpǝ kǝ lǝ ŋ kpii nǝ vurǝ, paa Wɛɛrǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ nǝ yee Worokoyǝ le epipǝ lǝǝwe. Ŋrǝ lóo koonu wǝ́ yǝ láa ca narǝwǝ yǝ ŋ tíi Worokoyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝ Tǝ! Mǝ Tǝ!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ ŋrǝŋrǝ ya lée tíi lǝ rǝ lah ziɔŋrǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ le ri Worokoyǝ le epipǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Kǝ́ wǝ ri ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ le ri Worokoyǝ le epipǝ kǝto we, yǝ lah pa lɔ otuceeceeyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ no co nǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ la garǝ la kʊla mǝ pǝ. Wǝ́ yǝ lah pa lɔ yǝ la kʊla mǝ Kǝriso. Mǝŋ kǝceece la ya yǝ láa cʊʊrʊ yǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ we, pǝ láa pa rɛɛrɩ mǝ ŋla ŋkpɛ pǝ kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otukpatɩyǝ we yǝ kpii yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mǝŋ lǝ fǝ rǝkǝsa la acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ sa la ya yǝ láa cʊʊrʊ la kaamǝ otukpatɩyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝh pǝ ŋ pa pɔrʊ ŋ kaŋ lǝ we, ŋ́ na lɔ ŋ́ no nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ sa yǝ lee ri tǝrɛ mǝŋ tɩ. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ǝrǝkǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ Worokoyǝ ŋ no co we, kǝ ya kǝ lǝ́ǝ rǝŋ eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ náa pɔrʊ ne epipǝ ŋ kaŋ wǝ, wǝ ya wǝ lóo yoyo kǝ rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋkǝ ǝrǝkǝ sa we, kǝ le fii rǝ okopikpaakpaayǝ rɛ lǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ. Ŋkǝ ŋkǝŋkǝ kǝ lǝ pǝ́ wǝ ǝnǝ. Paa Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ kǝ ŋ ne kpii rǝ okopiyǝ sa lǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ ǝnǝ. Paape we, kpɛɛtɛɛwǝ wǝ kpii wǝ koonu kǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Duturǝ ɖi, Worokoyǝ lah pa pɔrʊ kǝ jirǝ rɛ jeŋceŋ ŋ ru rǝ okopiyǝ sa la akaakǝ. Ŋyǝ okopiyǝ sa yǝ ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ nǝǝnǝ kǝ, wǝ́ yǝ lǝ fǝ kǝ yǝ le yee rɔŋyǝ wǝ. O lóo turu kǝ la ka kʊla mǝ Worokoyǝ le epipǝ le diiwɛɛkpatɩrǝ sa. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Le cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ǝrǝkǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ Worokoyǝ ŋ no co we, kǝ ya kǝ lóo fuu wǝ́ kǝ ya kǝ láa cʊʊrʊ rǝkǝsa mǝŋ tieyǝ ŋ nǝh mǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Paape ŋkǝ ǝrǝkǝ sa ceŋceŋ. Ŋlǝ epǝ we yǝ láa lɔ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ mǝŋ Worokoyǝ lo otukoonuyǝ la kǝtasǝsǝŋkǝ we, ŋla ŋkpɛ la ya yǝ lóo fuu rǝ lah ziɔŋrǝ mǝrǝ. La ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ rǝŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ lǝ ŋ yee ne epipǝ, kǝ ŋ pɔrʊ lah wɛlɛŋrǝ ŋ ru rǝ acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ la akaakǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ la lɔ lo koonu lǝ, we la ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ rǝŋ rǝ ko. Mǝŋ nyiyǝ la nyɩŋ tuwǝ we ŋ ya ŋ nǝ́ǝ rǝŋ we, we wǝ lǝǝ tǝ wǝ ri ǝrǝŋkǝ. Ǝlǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ tǝ mǝ ŋ yaa mǝ ŋ rǝŋ tuwǝ ŋ ya ŋ náa nyɩŋ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Paa mǝŋ la ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ rǝŋ tuwǝ we yǝ laa ya yǝ láa nyɩŋ we, yǝ láa tɔ yǝ ŋ yaa yǝ ŋ rǝŋ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Kaa wǝǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ ŋrǝ ŋkpɛ lǝ́ǝ pǝ lǝ ŋ toŋ lǝ rǝ lah wǝfɔkpǝ mǝrǝ. Duturǝ ɖi yǝ lǝŋ ci nyuŋkpǝ la amwɛŋ mǝŋ kǝ́ wǝ lǝ pǝ́ wǝ. Kǝto Wɛɛkenikenirǝ ŋrǝŋrǝ láa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ lǝ ŋ koonu lǝ mǝ anʊmʊkǝ rɛ yǝ lǝŋ ci atɛŋkǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Paa Worokoyǝ we ŋ náa nyɩŋ asiɔŋyǝ mǝrǝ we, lée ci tuwǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. Awo, Wɛɛkenikenirǝ láa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ lǝ ŋ koonu alɔnuŋtǝpǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Lǝ tǝ le cii ǝkǝnǝŋ tu ri ŋ tu wǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ mǝ wǝsiɛrɩkpǝ wǝ ŋ koonu epǝ we pǝ láa taa Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ wǝ, epǝ we ŋ no pwo saŋ rǝ no yupurǝ we ŋ ne yee ŋ no coonu wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Duturǝ ɖi epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na saa ŋ no coonu we, la lɛ lǝ fǝ la tɛɛ rǝ na wɛ lo coonu ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ no koonu pǝ ru ne Pi. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ ne Pi ŋ ri pisǝŋmǝyǝ ŋ koonu apaanʊpǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋmumuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na saa ŋ no coonu we, la lɛ lo pwo pǝ. Epǝ we ŋ no pwo we, la lɛ lǝ fǝ pǝ le yee enyikʊʊpǝ. Wǝ́ epǝ we ŋ nǝ fǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ we, la lɛ lǝ fǝ na wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ lo koonu pǝ.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ǝlǝ ŋ náa pa waarǝ lǝ ŋ cɛ rǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝtaawǝ wǝ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Kǝ́ lo tu wǝ́ yǝ lǝ́ǝ tǝ la tɛŋ le teeri wǝ? Mǝŋ Worokoyǝ kʊla mǝ lǝ wǝǝ, ǝlǝ ŋ née yi ŋ tɛɛ rǝ lǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ŋwǝ yǝ ǝnǝ ŋ nee ce ŋ kʊʊ ŋwǝŋwǝ nǝ Pi ŋ tǝnǝ, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ ŋwǝ ŋ no koonu rǝ loh yuwǝ wǝǝ, kǝ ŋ wɛɛ lǝŋ fǝ tu ri ŋ tu ŋ koonu lǝ ŋ cɛɛ ŋ kʊla mǝ ŋwǝ? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru ǝfǝ dierǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na saa ŋ na pɔrʊ wǝ? Rɛ lee kpii! Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ pǝ ŋ ne yee enyikʊʊpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru atɔɔ pǝla bɔrǝ wǝ? Rɛ lee kpii! Duturǝ ɖi Yesu Kǝriso lǝ kpǝ́, tǝ fǝ kʊla we, la saanǝ lo ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ. Yaa rǝ Worokoyǝ le kǝnirisiɛɛkǝ, wǝ́ ŋ ya ŋ náa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ mǝ ŋ koonu lǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Kǝ́ lo tu wǝ lóo koru awaarǝ lǝ wǝ cɛ rǝ Kǝriso lǝ kǝǝtaawǝ we ŋ lǝǝmǝ ŋ koonu lǝ wǝ? Acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ amaa kǝǝnǝwǝ? Kǝ́ enyipǝ pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ lǝ wǝ, amaa kǝtɛŋkǝ? Ariayǝ? Enilɛnyɩyǝ mǝrǝ amaa gbɛŋrǝ? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Ŋlǝ́ kǝto we, jɔkɔŋcirǝ le eni ri ŋ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">enyipǝ pǝ láa nyɩŋ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ amɛɛpǝ rɛ pǝ loh ko mǝ pǝ ka wʊ kǝtǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Paape rǝ otuyǝ sa kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ yǝ ŋ tuu lǝ mǝrǝ we, yǝ le ri yurǝ milimili saŋ rǝ yǝ we ŋ na taa lǝ kǝǝwǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Awo, ŋ́ na lɔ ŋ́ no nuŋ fee ǝkǝnǝŋ tǝrɛ wǝ lee kpii wǝ lah pa waarǝ lǝ wǝ cɛ rǝ nǝ kǝǝtaawǝ sa, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri gbɛŋrǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri vɔrʊrǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri epicoŋpipǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri awɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri otuyǝ we yǝ ya yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ ruŋruŋ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri eyǝ we yǝ kpii yǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ soosowǝ sa wǝ lo furu wǝ, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />wǝ ke ce wǝ ri okopiyǝ rǝ oŋuŋkǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri ǝyǝ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ, wǝ ke ce wǝ ri tupʊŋpwawǝ rǝ fǝŋ Worokoyǝ ŋ no co oo, tǝrɛ wǝ lee kpii wǝ loh po koru awaarǝ lǝ wǝ cɛ pwi rǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝtaawǝ we ŋ nǝ fǝ ŋ no koonu lǝ saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso wǝ!<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ la saa Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ le yee nǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ŋ́ ne yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Kǝriso, kǝto ŋ́ náa tɛŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ, ŋ́ nǝŋ nia. Wɛɛkenikenirǝ ɖe mǝ ziɔŋrǝ, wǝ́ mǝ ziɔŋrǝ ya lée ri ɖaŋsieyǝ lǝ ŋ tíi mǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋmǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɛŋ anʊkɔrǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ŋ́ ne fii rǝ kǝǝnǝmumuŋwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ ŋ́ re ŋ́ yaa mǝ vuurǝ rǝ ko. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Awo, ŋmǝŋmǝ kʊraa ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ ka fwɛɛrɩ mǝ kǝ ŋ́ sǝrǝ mǝ Kǝriso kǝ wǝ toŋ mǝ ǝtǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ. Ŋlǝ mǝ pǝ lǝ ri kǝkpǝŋkǝ kǝceŋceŋ le enyipǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Pǝ ri Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ. Worokoyǝ lǝ fǝ pǝ le yee ne epipǝ. La pɔrʊ na wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ la kaŋ pǝ. La parǝ etieyǝ mǝ pǝ lǝ tǝnǝ. Lǝ fǝ seyǝ lo koonu pǝ wǝ́ ŋ na kaŋ pǝ wǝlǝpoŋpikpǝ we pǝ láa sʊma ŋwǝ pǝ fǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ no co pǝla akayǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Ǝtǝtǝpǝ we pǝ lo ru nyɩŋrǝ le epilepipǝ wǝ́ pǝ ri. Pǝlǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ mǝrǝ wǝ́ pǝ lǝ mǝ Kǝriso pǝ lo ru mǝŋ nyɩmaasɩyǝ kǝtǝ, ŋwǝ yǝ ǝnǝ ŋ ri Worokoyǝ we ŋ teeri tu ri ŋ tu wǝ. Ŋwǝ ŋ kaamǝ ǝkǝkǝ kǝkpakǝkpa! Amɛnǝ.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ le dierǝ lǝǝ lǝǝrǝ rǝlo okuruyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Paape wǝ lee ri ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ la garǝ we ŋ cò lǝǝ pǝ oo! Kpiikǝ ŋkǝ epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lo ru rǝ Isǝrayɛlǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ mǝrǝ pǝ ri Isǝrayɛlǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋpoŋpikǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Wǝ́ ŋkǝ Abǝrahamǝ le epipǝ kpǝlo pǝ ri ne epipoŋpipǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ tìi Abǝrahamǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Isakǝ le epipǝ pǝ lée ri lǝ́ wǝmǝkpǝ wǝ». <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Wǝlo duturǝ ɖi we, ŋkǝ epipǝ pǝ lǝ mǝ saŋ rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ pǝ ri Worokoyǝ le epipǝ. Worokoyǝ le epipoŋpipǝ pǝ kaamǝ epǝ we Abǝrahamǝ ŋ mǝnǝ ŋ sanǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la garǝ we ŋ cò ŋwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ cò na garǝ sanǝ eni: «Ŋ́ nah pa siɛnɩ ŋ́ pǝ acɛŋ mǝ eniyǝ sa, Sara lǝ́ǝ mǝ bǝrǝŋpirǝ».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">1Mo 18:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Wǝ́ ŋkǝ wǝle fee wǝǝ, Rebeka ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ mǝnǝ awɛɛpipǝ kòonu tǝyǝ ceŋceŋ, ŋwǝ ŋ kaamǝ lǝh tǝtǝ Isakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Pǝ faa ka maa pǝ mǝ epipǝ sa kaa kǝ a tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ le yee ceeceewǝ rɛ amaa rɔɔrɔɔwǝ rɛ, wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ wɛ̀ɛlɩ mǝ Rebeka kǝ yupurǝ we ŋwǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ yeli ŋ còonu ŋ nya fɛɛ bǝ. Yupurǝ sa we, lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ la asaapɔrʊkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Asaapɔrʊkǝ sa we, kǝ loo ru rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ la anǝnɛyeeyǝ, paa kǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ we ŋ nóo pwo enyipǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ tìi Rebeka ǝkǝnǝŋ «Pimumuŋyǝ we lah pa sʊma pipiyǝ», <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ na taa Yakɔbǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ kpǝlǝ Esawʊ lǝ kǝǝwǝ».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">1Mo 25:23</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ? We Worokoyǝ laa kʊʊ? Kʊrakʊra, ŋkǝ kaa wǝǝ! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Duturǝ ɖi tìi Mose ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Yǝ we ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee lɛsiɛrɩwǝ we, ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ née yee lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ, wǝ́ yǝ we ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ nyɩŋ tǝlarǝwǝ we, ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ́ náa nyɩŋ tǝlarǝwǝ wǝ». <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kǝto wǝ loo ru rǝ nyɩmaasɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ amaa na anyɩɩkǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, paa wǝ lo ru rǝ Worokoyǝ we ceŋceŋ ŋ née yee lɛsiɛrɩwǝ lǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ mǝrǝ we, Worokoyǝ tìi Farawo ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ nǝ fǝ lǝ́ ŋ́ ne tiini wǝpilikpǝ kǝ ŋ́ nya fɛɛ ŋ́ pɔrʊ mǝ okopiyǝ ŋ́ kaŋ saŋ rǝ ló oŋuŋkǝ, kǝ ǝrǝkǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ kǝ nuŋ mǝ nyɩŋrǝ». <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kǝto we, yǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ nyɩŋ tǝlarǝwǝ we, ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ náa nyɩŋ tǝlarǝwǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ yǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ pǝ́ ŋ lɛnyɩ yurǝ we, ŋwǝ wǝ́ ŋ nóo koonu ŋ lɛnyɩ yurǝ wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ mǝ na tǝlarǝnyɩŋwǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Rɛ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ mǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ wǝ lǝ ǝnǝ wǝǝ, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ tǝ mǝ ŋ kpaŋ mǝ nyiyǝ wǝ? Duturǝ ɖi ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru eyi ŋ tɛɛ rǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝǝpǝ́wǝ wǝ?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ŋ́ reemǝ we, ŋlǝ́ e ri ǝlǝ, ŋlǝ́ nyɩmaasɩyǝ, kǝ a yaa mǝ tiini dierǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ wǝ? Kǝkǝtǝǝsiɛkǝ kǝ lóo koru ǝpǝ́ kǝla yaatǝyǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a la yaa mǝ ǝ lǝ fǝ ǝnǝ?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kǝto kpɛɛyaatǝyǝ lǝŋ koru ǝfǝ na fɔɔyǝ ŋ yee tuwǝ wǝ ponu mǝ ŋwǝ wǝ? Lóo koru ǝfǝ fɔɔyǝ sa ne ceŋceŋ ŋ yaa kǝsiɛkǝ kǝ lo ru okuruyǝ amaa kǝsiɛkǝ rǝ ko.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Worokoyǝ lǝ pǝ́ ŋ pɔrʊ na kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ŋ kaŋ akpɛɛyǝ we na kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ sa wǝ tɛɛ rǝ wǝ, mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ pǝ nyɩŋ no okopiyǝ pǝ ci. Paape we, enyipǝ we pǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ akpɛɛyǝ we lo oŋuŋkǝ Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ wǝ ka tɛɛ rǝ ǝkǝ ŋ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ ŋ nǝǝnǝ we, ŋwǝ Worokoyǝ la nyɩŋ pǝ la tǝlarǝwǝ ŋpa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Worokoyǝ le yee wǝ ǝnǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ ŋ pɔrʊ na anaanǝkǝ ŋ kaŋ enyituturupǝ, epǝ we ŋ na nyɩŋ tǝlarǝwǝ wǝ. Epǝ we ŋ na kpaka ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ ŋ no coonu pǝ pa kʊla mǝ ne wǝpilirikpǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Wǝ́ ŋpǝ enyipǝ sa we, ŋlǝ lǝ lǝǝwe. Lo pwo lǝ ŋkǝ rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ mǝrǝ sɔŋ, paa rǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ mǝrǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Tuwǝ sa wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ na tɛŋ rǝ Oze la kǝfwɛɛkǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Kǝkpǝŋkǝ we kǝ lee ke ri mǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we, ŋ́ noh mǝ pwo kǝ mǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">wǝ́ nyiyǝ we ŋ́ naa ka ŋ taa kǝǝwǝ we, ŋ́ noh mǝ pwo ŋwǝ mǝ kǝǝtaatǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Fɛɛwǝ we tutu pǝ tìi enyipǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Nǝ nyee ri mǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ” we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">fɛɛwǝ we ke wǝ́ pǝ loh mǝ pwo pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ “Worokoyǝ we ŋ kpii vɔrʊrǝ le epipǝ”».<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ezaya ŋwǝ paa we, la tɛŋ lo ru rǝ Isǝrayɛlǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Wǝ ke ce wǝ ri Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ pǝ la naanǝ yɔwǝ mǝŋ apʊyǝ la naŋrǝ kǝtǝ we, pǝla kǝtapikǝ rɛ ko kǝ láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Duturǝ ɖi Ǝtǝ Woroko lo tuwǝ ŋ na tɛŋ we, lée yee wǝ kɩɩkɩ rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ, lǝŋ lǝǝrǝ eniyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ŋwǝ Ezaya ke tɛnɩ còonu ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Mǝŋ Ǝtǝ Woroko Kopilǝtǝyǝ laa ka maa wǝmǝpikpǝ rɛ ŋ tǝnǝ lǝ we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">la ka sìɛrɩ le yeli rǝ mǝŋ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Sodomǝ kǝtǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">lo ko ru tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Gomora wǝ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɩrɩ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:23-28">1Mo 19:23-28</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dieceeceerǝ we ɖi Oyudatǝpǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝla nɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Kǝ́ wǝ́ yǝ lah tɛŋ rǝkǝsa? Le reemǝ we, enyipǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ we, pǝ laa ka ŋ fia pǝ ŋ yɩrɩ kǝ pǝ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. Paape lǝ fǝ pǝ le yee enyikʊʊpǝ mǝ kǝ́ pǝ la lɔ pǝ lo nuŋ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ ŋpǝ paa we, pǝ ka ŋ nyɩɩ pǝ ŋ yee pǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ, paape pǝ loo koru. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kǝ́ kǝto? Kpiikǝ pǝ laa ka ŋ taa akʊʊkǝ sa saŋ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ, paa wǝ́ pǝ ka ŋ tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋpǝ pǝ láa nya kǝ saŋ rǝ pǝla anǝnɛyeeyǝ. Pǝ lo tuu niɛpirǝ rǝ ɖurǝ we lóo co enyipǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ kǝtǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Nǝ nuŋ sɩsiɛrɩ, rǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Ziɔŋ we, ŋ́ nah tɔ ɖurǝ rɛ enyipǝ pǝ loh mǝ tuu niɛpirǝ pǝ ŋ tɔɔ wǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">ɖutɛɛrǝ rɛ lóo coolu enyipǝ wǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Paa yǝ we ŋ náa lɔ ŋwǝ ŋ nuŋ we, lǝŋ pe fii nʊŋsɔɔwǝ».<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulǝtǝyǝ ceŋceŋ koonu Oyudatǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, tuwǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ru ǝrǝ mǝ ziɔŋrǝ ǝkǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɔɔ mǝ ŋ kpɛɛ Worokoyǝ mǝ ŋ ru rǝ wǝ wǝ kaamǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ nya alɔkuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋ́ nóo koru eri ɖaŋsieyǝ ŋ koonu pǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ pǝ lǝŋ kuŋ Worokoyǝ la zʊmarǝ lo oru, paape pǝ lee ke ci kǝ́ pǝ lah sʊma ŋwǝ sɩsiɛrɩ pǝ fǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Pǝ loo nuŋ wǝlǝkpǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ enyipǝ mǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ lo duturǝ. Wǝ́ pǝ lǝ pǝ́ ŋpǝŋpǝ pǝ nya wǝlǝkpǝ pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ pǝla wɛ pǝ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, wǝ́ pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ wǝlǝkpǝ we ŋ nǝ́ǝ fǝ enyipǝ mǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ pǝ lo co. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Duturǝ ɖi Kǝriso la pa yaalǝ Mose le seyǝ lo okopiyǝ, kǝ epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la lɔ ŋwǝ pǝ lo nuŋ we, Worokoyǝ ŋ fǝ pǝ ŋ yee enyikʊʊpǝ rǝ na kǝnyɩŋkǝ.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mose ŋwǝŋwǝ la ŋʊrʊ lo ru rǝ kǝ́ nyiyǝ ŋ nóo koru eyee nyikʊʊyǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ rǝ kǝ́ ŋ ne yee ŋ na saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ wǝ. La tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyiyǝ we ŋ née yee mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ lo otutɛŋyǝ we, lée tii vɔrʊrǝ saŋ rǝ yǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Paa nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la wɛɛlɩ wǝ lo ru rǝ kǝ́ nyiyǝ ŋ náa kʊʊ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ saŋ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ wǝǝ: «Paa tɛŋ rǝ lǝ́ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: “Ǝlǝ ŋ nah pa rɛ yulaarǝ wǝ?”» O lóo turu a ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ asʊʊ mǝ Kǝriso rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Paa lɛ a tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝlǝ ŋ náa sʊʊ akpɛŋtɛkǝ wǝ?» O lóo turu a ya lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ Kǝriso ŋ ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ ŋ rɛ rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />We kǝ́ le die bomu wǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ ya wǝ láa tɛŋ wǝ? Wǝ ya wǝ láa tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Dierǝ we maarǝ mǝ lǝ́ rǝ, gbii lǝ́ rǝ nyuŋkpǝ mǝ lá ziɔŋrǝ.» Dierǝ sa gaamǝ lɔnuŋrǝ le dierǝ sa la ya yǝ láa tɛŋ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Mǝŋ o lo wuru ló nyuŋkpǝ a la tɛŋ rǝ enyikpǝlo la kǝnyɩŋkǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Yesu ŋ ri Kulǝtǝyǝ, wǝ́ a la lɔ o lo nuŋ rǝ lá ziɔŋrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ la saanǝ ŋwǝ lo ru rǝ enyiǝtǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, a láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Duturǝ ɖi yǝ we ŋ na lɔ ŋ no nuŋ rǝ na ziɔŋrǝ we, Worokoyǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ ŋwǝ mǝ ŋ yee nyikʊʊyǝ, yǝ we ŋ no wuru no nyuŋkpǝ ŋ na tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋwǝ ŋ na lɔ ŋ no nuŋ we, Worokoyǝ láa lɔ ŋ koonu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ na lɔ ŋwǝ ŋ no nuŋ we, lǝŋ pe fii nʊŋsɔɔwǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Mǝŋkǝsa we, wǝsǝpǝkpǝ rɛ wǝ lee kpii rǝ Oyudatǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ. Pǝlo kpǝlo pǝ lǝǝmǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ née yee wǝceeceekpǝ mǝ ŋ koonu epǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lóo pwo ŋwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ nóo pwo Kulǝtǝyǝ la nyɩŋrǝ we, láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ».<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Wǝ́ pǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ pǝ pwo ŋwǝ mǝŋ pǝ laa lɔ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ wǝ? Wǝ́ pǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ pǝ lɔ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ mǝŋ pǝ loo nuŋ pǝ wɛɛlɩ pǝ ru rǝ ŋwǝ wǝ? Wǝ́ pǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ pǝ nuŋ pǝ wɛɛlɩ pǝ ru rǝ ŋwǝ, mǝŋ rɛ laa tɛŋ ne dierǝ ŋ tíi pǝ wǝ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Wǝ́ pǝ lée yee nɛ kǝ pǝ tɛŋ ne dierǝ mǝŋ pǝ lee kpii enyipǝ pǝ maŋ pǝ ka tɛŋ rǝ wǝ? Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Kǝ́ epǝ we pǝ láa tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ lǝ ǝpǝkǝ kǝ láa ca kpɛɛ ayɩrɩkǝ we!» <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Paape ŋkǝ enyipǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la lɔ tuwǝ we la ya yǝ láa tɛŋ pǝ lo nuŋ. Ezaya màrǝ tɛnɩ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ǝtǝ Woroko, ǝlǝ ŋ na lɔ Dieceeceerǝ sa la ya yǝ láa tɛŋ ŋ no nuŋ wǝ?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kǝto we, nyiyǝ láa lɔ mǝ ŋ nuŋ saŋ rǝ dierǝ we ŋ no nuŋ pǝ la tɛŋ wǝ. Wǝ́ ŋrǝ dierǝ sa gaamǝ Kǝriso le dierǝ.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Rǝkǝsa ŋ́ pǝ́ oo, kǝto Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ loo nuŋ dierǝ sa? Ǝŋkǝ́! Pǝ lo nuŋ dierǝ sa. Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Pǝ lo nuŋ etietɛŋtǝpǝ la kpɛɛwǝ sa rǝ kǝtǝǝwǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">wǝ́ pǝle etieyǝ sa yǝ lo ko ru ǝrǝ ǝrǝkǝ la kǝkpaakǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ŋ́ tǝ ŋ́ pǝ́ oo, kǝto Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ kǝ loo nuŋ dierǝ sa etietɛŋtǝpǝ pǝ tɛnɩ lo duturǝ? Mose ŋ ke ri nyisǝsǝŋyǝ ŋ conu atɛnɩ Worokoyǝ le dietɛŋrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Ŋ́ noh po koonu nǝ yee epǝ we kaŋfɩ pǝ lee ri kǝkpǝŋpoŋpikǝ la wǝtɛlɩkpǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Ŋ́ neh pe kpii nǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ŋ́ tɛɛ rǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ rɛ kǝ lee ci otuyǝ wǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Ezaya ŋwǝ lo tu turuwǝ la tɛŋ Worokoyǝ le dietɛŋrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Epǝ we pǝ laa ka ŋ taa mǝ we, ŋpǝ pǝ la pa nyɩŋ mǝ wǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Ŋ́ na pɔrʊ mǝ wɛ ŋ́ na kaŋ epǝ we pǝ lǝǝ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ mǝ tǝrɛ wǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Paa ru rǝ Isǝrayɛlǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ we, Worokoyǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ji ri ŋ ji we, ŋ́ nóo wuru nyuŋkpǝ mǝŋ ko rǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ rɛ kǝ lǝŋ nuŋ mǝ tutɛŋwǝ wǝ́ kǝ le yi kǝ la tɛɛ rǝ mǝ lǝ kpǝŋ».<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Worokoyǝ lǝǝ sǝ́ŋ Isǝrayɛlǝ ŋ co</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ oo, we kǝto Worokoyǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ nǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ lo co? Kʊrakʊra! Duturǝ ɖi ŋmǝŋmǝ ŋ́ ri Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpiyǝ, Abǝrahamǝ le pilepiyǝ, ŋ́ no ru rǝ Bɛnǝyaminǝ lǝ gbǝŋrǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Worokoyǝ lǝǝ sǝ́ŋ nǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we ŋwǝŋwǝ ŋ na saa ŋ na pɔrʊ ŋ no coonu ŋ co. Nǝ cii tuwǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we Eliya ŋ pǝlǝ ŋ ka ŋ nʊmʊ mǝ ŋ kpii Worokoyǝ rǝ Isǝrayɛlǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ yurǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />«Ǝtǝ Woroko, pǝ la wʊʊlʊ lá akpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ, wǝ́ pǝ la wɔɔlʊ ló wǝtoolucuukpǝ. Ŋmǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ́ no tuuru wǝ́ pǝ ya pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ pǝ wʊ mǝ!» <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Kǝ́ wǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ kpǝ̀lǝŋ ŋ tìi ŋwǝ? Tìi ŋwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Ŋ́ na kʊʊ enyipǝ lafawǝ pǝrɩmata ŋ́ nǝ tǝnǝ mǝ wɛ, epǝ we pǝ laa sʊma diŋrǝ we pǝ lóo pwo Baalǝ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baalǝ ri rǝ Akanaŋtǝpǝ le diŋrǝ rɛ.</char></note> wǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Kaa wǝǝ, ruŋruŋ le jirǝ we, Worokoyǝ la saa kǝnyikpǝŋpikǝ rɛ lǝ tǝnǝ saŋ rǝ na lɛsiɛrɩwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Le yee pǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ, wǝ́ ŋ na saa pǝ, ŋkǝ rǝ pǝlo tuyeewǝ rɛ kǝto wǝ́ ŋ na saa pǝ wǝ. Wǝ kǝh lǝ ǝnǝ we, we Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ sa wǝ lǝŋ kǝ tǝ wǝ ri lɛsiɛrɩwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kǝ́? Tuwǝ we Isǝrayɛlǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ kǝ ka ŋ taa we, kǝ laa nya wǝ. Epǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ na saa ŋ na pɔrʊ ceŋceŋ ko pǝ la nya wǝ wǝ. Otuturupǝ we we, pǝ la lɛnyɩ yurǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ ya wǝ láa tɛŋ wǝ kǝtǝ, ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Worokoyǝ lo koonu yurǝ lǝ kpǝ́ pǝ, le sii pǝle enimiyǝ kǝ pǝ paa nyɩŋ, wǝ́ ŋ na taŋ pǝlo otukoŋyǝ kǝ pǝ poo nuŋ, po ro ruŋruŋ le jirǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Davidǝ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Pǝle keeriwǝ wǝ siɛrɩ wǝ yee kpɛrɛwǝ kǝ wǝ lɔ pǝ, fuŋwǝ kǝ pǝ tɔɔ wǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">Pǝle keeriwǝ wǝ siɛrɩ wǝ yee ɖurǝ pǝ loh tuu niɛpirǝ kǝ pǝ tɔɔ, kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ ta pǝlo kǝtukoŋkǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Enimiyǝ yǝ sii pǝ kpǝŋ kǝ pǝ pǝǝ tǝ pǝ nyɩŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">koonu pǝ ru otusukǝ kǝkpakǝkpa».<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Rǝkǝsa ŋ́ pǝ́ oo, kǝto kǝ́ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ lo tuu niɛpirǝ wǝǝ, we pǝ lo ru pǝ la tɔɔ kǝkpakǝkpa? Kʊrakʊra! Paape we, pǝlo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ pǝ le yee we, wǝ lo kuŋ wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ la nya alɔkuŋkǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ yee enyipǝ sa la wǝtɛlɩkpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ lo turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ lǝ pǝ mǝ wǝpɛɛrɩmumuŋkpǝ rɛ wǝ lo koonu ǝrǝkǝ, wǝ́ pǝla atɔɔkǝ kǝ lǝ pǝ mǝ wǝpɛɛrɩmumuŋkpǝ rɛ kǝ lo koonu epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ we, we wǝpɛɛrɩkpǝ wǝ lǝh pǝ tǝ wǝ naanǝ wǝ ke teeri mǝŋ Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ la nya alɔkuŋkǝ wǝ!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Rǝkǝsa we, ŋ reemǝ ŋnǝ epǝ we nǝ nyee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ. Ŋ́ ri nyikpiiyǝ ŋ koonu epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ, wǝ́ kǝ́ wǝ lǝ ǝnǝ we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ kǝ mǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ sa. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ saŋ rǝ mǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ sa we, lǝh ǝtǝŋ Oyudatǝpǝ la wǝtɛlɩkpǝ sa wǝ ta wǝ kʊla rǝ, kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ lɔ ŋ koonu pǝla arɛɛpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Duturǝ ɖi kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ na cɛ pǝ ŋ nǝ tǝnǝ we, wǝ́ ŋ na ca ǝrǝkǝ ŋ ne kpii mǝ na wɛ. Wǝ́ mǝŋ Worokoyǝ lǝ pǝ tǝ la siɛnɩ la lɔ pǝ la maarǝ mǝ na wɛ wǝǝ, wǝ lǝh pǝ lǝ nɛ? Wǝ lǝ́ǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ enyiǝtǝpǝ pǝ la saanǝ kǝtǝ!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Mǝŋ pǝ lǝ fǝ kpɔnɔsǝsǝŋyǝ pǝ lo koonu Worokoyǝ we, kpɔnɔtuturuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ ri Worokoyǝ la nɛŋ. Mǝŋ pǝ lǝ fǝ wǝciikpǝ rɛ lo okuruŋkuyǝ pǝ lo koonu Worokoyǝ we, oturu wǝla alaŋyǝ ŋyǝ ŋkpɛ yǝ ri Worokoyǝ la anɛŋ. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ pǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ wǝciikpǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ na tɔ, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ sǝǝrǝ wǝciikpǝ sa la alaŋrɛɛyǝ ŋ na cɛ. Ŋlǝ́ yǝ ǝnǝ e lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ we, ǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ wǝciikpǝ wǝ yaa rǝ bɔɔrǝ la laŋwǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ sǝ. Wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ lǝ́ ŋ na pa maarǝ rǝ wǝciikpǝ we ŋ na tɔ wǝ. La maarǝ lǝ́ la kʊla mǝ wǝciikpǝ sa la alaŋyǝ we yǝ lo tuuru wǝ. Rǝkǝsa we, ŋlá ŋkpɛ a ya láa nya mɛŋwǝ sa wǝ lo ru rǝ wǝciikpǝ sa Worokoyǝ ŋ na tɔ lo kuruŋkuwǝ mǝŋ wǝciikpǝ sa la alaŋyǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Kǝto we, pee ci kǝ a fʊʊ alaŋyǝ sa pǝ lǝ sǝ pǝ lo co ǝ sǝǝlǝ. Nɛ kǝto wǝ́ a láa rɛɛrɩ mǝ lá wɛ wǝ? Taalǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋkǝ ŋlǝ́ e re kuruŋkuwǝ sa, paa kuruŋkuwǝ sa wǝ re lǝ́ wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ayɩrɛ a lah mǝ tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pǝ lǝ sǝ alaŋyǝ sa kǝ pǝ fǝ ŋmǝ pǝ maarǝ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Kǝceece, pǝ lǝ sǝǝrǝ yǝ kpiikǝ yǝ laa lɔ yǝ nuŋ kǝto. Wǝ́ ŋlǝ́ we, a maarǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we rǝ lá lɔnuŋrǝ kǝto. Kǝto paa rɛɛrɩ mǝ lá wɛ! Bomu suu Worokoyǝ lo vurǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ Worokoyǝ laa nyɩŋ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ ri wǝciikpǝ we pǝ la tɔ la alaŋpoŋpiyǝ we la tǝlarǝwǝ we, yee yurǝ, lǝŋ pa nyɩŋ lǝ́ tǝlarǝwǝ oo! <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Kǝto nyɩŋ wǝ e ci ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ we ŋ náa nyɩŋ nyiyǝ la tǝlarǝwǝ we, ŋwǝ ke ŋ náa lɛnyɩ enimiyǝ mǝ nyiyǝ wǝ. Lɛnyɩ enimiyǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ la tɔɔ wǝ, wǝ́ ŋ náa nyɩŋ lǝ́ tǝlarǝwǝ. Paa we, wǝ kpii kǝ ǝ tǝ a mǝ tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ na tǝlarǝnyɩŋwǝ sa ko, mǝŋ ŋkǝ kaa wǝǝ we, lǝ́ǝ pǝ sǝ ŋlá ŋkpɛ ŋ co mǝŋ alaŋtuturuyǝ we kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Wǝ́ mǝŋ jirǝ rɛ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ la tɛɛnɩ ŋpǝ pǝ láa lɔ pǝ nuŋ we, Worokoyǝ láa lɔ pǝ ŋ maarǝ rǝ fɛɛwǝ we pǝ ka yaa eniyǝ nɔ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ ŋ náa siɛnɩ ŋ lɔ pǝ ŋ maarǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ŋlǝ́ we, wǝciikpǝ rǝ bɔɔrǝ la laŋwǝ wǝ́ e ri. Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ sǝ lǝ́, wǝ́ ŋ nǝ fǝ lǝ́ ŋ na pa maarǝ rǝ wǝciikpǝ we pǝ la tɔ wǝ. Ŋkǝ kǝ́ pǝ lée pi pǝ ŋ yee wǝǝ. Paa Oyudatǝpǝ we, ŋpǝ pǝ ri wǝciikpǝ we pǝ la tɔ la alaŋpoŋpiyǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ wǝ laa lɛnyɩ mǝ Worokoyǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ alaŋyǝ sa ŋ siɛnɩ ŋ ka maarǝ rǝ yǝle wǝciikpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isǝrayɛlǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, nǝ nyǝŋ nyɩŋ, tuŋwaawǝ we ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ nǝ ci wǝǝ, kǝ nǝ paa nya fɛɛ nǝ fǝ nǝ wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ enimisietǝpǝ wǝ́ nǝ ri. Tuwǝ sa wǝ ri ǝkǝnǝŋ: Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ la kǝtarɛɛkǝ pǝ lǝ tǝnǝ kǝtukoŋkǝ ko ro kǝ́ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ láa nya alɔkuŋkǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Eniyǝ we wǝ́ Isǝrayɛlǝtǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lée ci anya alɔkuŋkǝ, mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ kǝtǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«Pɔrʊtǝyǝ lóo ru rǝ Ziɔŋ ŋ pǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">lǝh pǝ fǝ Yakɔbǝ le epilepipǝ lo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ cɛɛ pǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Dierǝ we ŋ́ nah pa parǝ mǝ pǝ ŋ́ tǝnǝ gaamǝ tuwǝ sa ǝnǝ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">Ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ fǝ pǝlo oturɔɔrɔɔyǝ ŋ́ cɛɛ pǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Pǝ lǝ sǝ́ŋ Dieceeceerǝ we, wǝ́ pǝ la siɛrɩ pǝ le yee Worokoyǝ lǝ ǝkǝǝkpǝlǝtǝpǝ, wǝ́ wǝ lo toŋ ŋnǝ epǝ we nǝ nyee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ. Paape mǝŋ la yɩrɩ rǝ Worokoyǝ la asaapɔrʊkǝ we, Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ tǝ pǝ ri Worokoyǝ lǝ ǝkǝǝtaatǝpǝ rǝ pǝlǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ lo yurǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ nǝŋ siɛnɩ ŋ lɔ tuwǝ ŋ no koonu nyiyǝ wǝ́ nǝŋ cɛkɛlɛ no yupurǝ ko rǝ enyipǝ we ŋ no pwo lǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Eniyǝ nɔ we, nǝ nyoo ko ŋ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ, paa rǝkǝsa we, Worokoyǝ la nyɩŋ nǝ tǝlarǝwǝ kpiikǝ Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ loo co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ ŋwǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Kaa wǝǝ, rǝkǝsa mǝŋ pǝlo kǝtukoŋloocokǝ kǝ lo koonu wǝ́ nǝ nya nya ǝfǝcɛɛkǝ we, Worokoyǝ lǝ pǝ́ ŋ nyɩŋ pǝla tǝlarǝwǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Worokoyǝ lo koonu kǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ poo co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ ŋwǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ nyɩŋ pǝlo kpǝlo la tǝlarǝwǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wǝ kpii kǝ anyɩmaasɩpǝ pǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Kǝceece, Worokoyǝ la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ naanǝ ŋpa oo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ne nimisiewǝ wǝ naanǝ ŋpa wǝ́ ŋ cii tu ri ŋ tu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru o nuŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ náa nyɩŋ otuyǝ mǝ ŋ fǝ lo duturǝ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ǝlǝ ŋ nóo koru eci na akʊŋyǝ?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Ǝlǝ ŋ no koru eci Ǝtǝ Woroko lo yupurǝ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Ǝlǝ ŋ no koru eri ne cikaŋtǝyǝ?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Ǝlǝ ŋ na cɛɛ Worokoyǝ lo tuwǝ ŋ na nyɩŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">kǝ oturu wǝ kpii kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ mwara yǝ we lǝ wǝ wǝ?»<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Duturǝ ɖi tu ri ŋ tu wǝ lo ru rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ, ŋwǝ ŋ no koonu wǝ́ tu ri ŋ tu wǝ kpii wǝ koonu ŋwǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Worokoyǝ ŋ kaamǝ ǝkǝkǝ kǝkpakǝkpa! Amɛnǝ.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Vɔrʊŋwɛŋrǝ mǝ Kǝriso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, Worokoyǝ la nyɩŋ lǝ tǝlarǝwǝ ŋpa. Wǝ kǝto ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɔɔ mǝ ŋ kpɛɛ nǝ kpuŋkpuruŋ, nǝ fǝ ŋnǝŋnǝ nǝ wɛ nǝ koonu Worokoyǝ, mǝŋ toolukɛɛyǝ ŋ no to, pǝ la kʊʊ pǝ lǝ tǝnǝ Worokoyǝ, ǝkǝ ŋ náa ca na kpɛɛwǝ wǝ. Ŋ wǝ wǝ ri wǝlǝpoŋpikpǝ we yǝ láa sʊma Worokoyǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Nǝ paa karǝ rǝkǝsa lǝ ǝrǝkǝ sa le enyipǝ lo otuyeeyǝ, paa nǝ maa Worokoyǝ ŋ siɛrɩ nǝ kǝ ŋ koonu nǝ otuciŋwɛŋyǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, nǝ nyáa nyɩŋ tuwǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ nǝ ci: Tuwǝ wǝ ponu, tuwǝ wǝ láa ca na kpɛɛ mǝ tuwǝ wǝ lo to milimili wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Rǝ tuwǝ sa Worokoyǝ ŋ no koonu mǝ saŋ rǝ na lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝto we, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi ǝkǝnǝŋ rɛ ŋ pee yee otukǝŋkǝŋtuyǝ, bomu nǝ nyɩŋ nǝ wɛ mǝŋ kǝ́ ŋnǝŋnǝ nǝ lǝ wǝ, nyi ri ŋ nyi mǝŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ ŋ no koonu na lɔnuŋrǝ ŋ nǝ fǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Lǝ lǝǝmǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi wɛlɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ, paape okpuŋtuyǝ yǝ naanǝ, wǝ́ yǝ lǝǝmǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ kpookpoo. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Kaa wǝǝ, mǝŋkǝ́ la naanǝ kpǝŋwǝ we, loh kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ le yee wɛlɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ mǝ kǝ́ yǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ mǝ Kǝriso wǝ. Wǝ́ loh kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ lo toomu mǝ awɛ mǝŋ wɛlɛŋrǝ jeŋceŋ lo okpuŋtuyǝ kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Lǝ lǝǝmǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi tukoonuwǝ kpookpoo. Worokoyǝ ŋ no koonu lǝ yǝ rǝ na lɛsiɛrɩwǝ mǝrǝ, lǝ fǝ le mǝ yee anǝnɛyǝ. Mǝŋ rɛ lǝǝmǝ tukoonuwǝ mǝ ŋ nuŋ Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛwǝ mǝ ŋ tɛŋ we, yǝ we mǝ ŋ yee wǝla kǝnǝnɛkǝ mǝ ŋ saŋ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Mǝŋ rɛɛyǝ Worokoyǝ lo koonu ŋwǝ mǝ ŋ toŋ otuturupǝ we, yǝ we mǝ ŋ toŋ pǝ. Yǝ we ŋ na lɔ otukaŋyǝ lo tukoonuwǝ we, yǝ we mǝ ŋ kaŋ otuyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Mǝŋ rɛ la lɔ turutawǝ lo tukoonuwǝ we, yǝ we mǝ ŋ ta enyipǝ lo turuwǝ. Yǝ we ŋ nóo koonu nyiyǝ lo tuwǝ we, mǝ ŋ koonu wǝ mǝ na ziɔŋrǝ fee. Mǝŋ rɛ lée re kǝkpǝŋkǝ we, yǝ we ŋ yee wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ. Mǝŋ rɛ láa nyɩŋ enyipǝ la tǝlarǝwǝ we, yǝ we mǝ ŋ yee wǝ mǝ faawǝ.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Nǝ fǝ kǝǝtaapoŋpiwǝ nǝ taa awɛ lǝ kǝǝwǝ. Nǝ suu rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lǝ kpǝŋ, kǝ nǝ kpaa nǝ maarǝ mǝ tuceeceewǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Nǝ taa awɛ lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝŋ apaanʊpǝ rǝ Kǝriso mǝrǝ kǝtǝ. Nǝ ri ǝsǝsǝŋpǝ pǝ láa pɛɛlɩ pǝ ŋ koonu awɛ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Nǝ kpii wɛɛlɛŋwǝ rǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ, nǝ pee yee fanaciwǝ. Nǝ fǝ nǝ ziɔŋrǝ fee nǝ sʊma Ǝtǝ Woroko mǝ naawǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Nǝ nya faawǝ rǝ nǝ ǝrǝŋkǝ kǝto. Nǝ nya lɛtaarǝwǝ rǝ acʊcʊʊrʊyǝ mǝrǝ. Nǝ tɔ nǝ yaa rǝ nyuŋmwɛŋwǝ eni ri ŋ ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Nǝ toŋ nǝ ǝtǝŋpǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ ariaayǝ mǝrǝ wǝ. Nǝ mǝ lɔ epǝ we pǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ lǝ kǝsǝǝkǝ sɩsiɛrɩ.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Nǝ pǝ́ Worokoyǝ la wǝpɛɛrɩkpǝ nǝ koonu epǝ we pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ nǝ wǝ. Awo, nǝ pɛɛrɩ pǝ, nǝ paa fwɛɛrɩ pǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Nǝ nya faawǝ nǝ kʊla mǝ epǝ we pǝ ya pǝ láa nya faawǝ wǝ, kǝ nǝ wee nǝ kʊla mǝ epǝ we pǝ ya pǝ lée wee wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Nǝ fǝ wǝnyuŋceŋceŋkpǝ nǝ re awɛ. Nǝ pee mǝ yee otukǝŋkǝŋtuyǝ, paa nǝ toomu kǝloŋkǝ mǝ epǝ we enyipǝ pǝ lǝŋ kǝ pǝ kpii rǝ tǝrɛ mǝrǝ wǝ. Nǝ paa nyɩŋ nǝ wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋnǝ nǝ ri enimisietǝpǝ.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nǝ pǝǝ fǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ nǝ ca turɔɔrɔɔwǝ la kpawǝ. Wǝceeceeyeekpǝ wǝ lɔ kǝtiikǝ rǝ nǝ ziɔŋrǝ rǝ enyikpǝlo la kǝnyɩŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Nǝ nyɩɩ mǝŋ nǝ nyóo koru wǝ́ wǝ lóo ru rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ we, nǝ tii rǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ mǝ enyipǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ ǝkǝǝtaatǝpǝ, nǝ paa ca kpawǝ ŋnǝŋnǝ, paa nǝ maa Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ wǝ yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ wǝ koonu nǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Ǝtǝ Woroko la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">«Ŋmǝ ŋ náa ca kpawǝ wǝ, ŋmǝ ŋ́ nah pa mwara nyi ri ŋ nyi lo wǝtookpǝ wǝ!» <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Paape lǝ tǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Mǝŋ kǝtɛŋkǝ kǝ ya kǝ láa wʊ lǝ́ kǝǝkpǝlǝtǝyǝ we, koonu ŋwǝ ŋ ri, mǝŋ kǝmɛŋtɛŋkǝ kǝ ya kǝ láa wʊ ŋwǝ we, koonu na mɛŋwǝ ŋ ŋuŋ. Duturǝ ɖi vǝ́ e le yee wǝ ǝnǝ we, wǝ lǝ́ǝ lǝ rǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ a ya láa tɛɛ na anaakʊyǝ rǝ yurǝ kǝtǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Paa maa turɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ ri ló yurǝ. Paa fǝ tuceeceewǝ e ri turɔɔrɔɔwǝ lo yurǝ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Nǝ pu gǝŋrǝ la asaatiitǝpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ pɛɛlɩ ŋ koonu gǝŋrǝ la asaatiitǝpǝ. Duturǝ ɖi rɛ lǝŋ koru etii zaarǝ mǝŋ ŋkǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ ne tiini ŋwǝ. Asaatiitǝpǝ sa pǝ kpii we, Worokoyǝ ŋ ne tiini pǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kǝto nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ ne yi ŋ na tɛɛ rǝ saatiitǝyǝ rɛ we, yǝ we le yi la tɛɛ rǝ Worokoyǝ lo tutǝnǝwǝ. Yǝ we ŋ née yee wǝ ǝnǝ we, ŋwǝŋwǝ la taa wǝkpaŋtɛŋkpǝ lo co na wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Epǝ we pǝ lée yee tuceeceewǝ we, pǝ lǝŋ suu asaatiitǝpǝ lo vurǝ, paa epǝ we pǝ lée yee turɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, ŋpǝ pǝ lóo suu pǝ wǝ. Mǝŋ ǝ lǝ́ǝ pǝ́ o poo mǝ suu asaatiitǝpǝ lo vurǝ we, we mǝ yee tuceeceewǝ kǝ pǝ ŋ kǝ lǝ́. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Duturǝ ɖi asaatiitǝpǝ pǝ ya pǝ lée yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ pǝ ŋ koonu Worokoyǝ kǝ pǝ kpii lǝ́ okopiyǝ e mǝ yee ceeceewǝ. Paa mǝŋ e lée yee rɔɔrɔɔwǝ we, we mǝ suu pǝ! Duturǝ ɖi ŋkǝ tuŋtuŋ wǝ́ pǝ lée re tʊkʊwǝ pǝ ŋ ta nyiyǝ lo kǝtukoŋkǝ wǝ! Pǝ ya pǝ lée yee Worokoyǝ la kǝnǝnɛkǝ rǝ, kǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ pɔrʊ na kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ pǝ kaŋ yǝ we ŋ née yee rɔɔrɔɔwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kǝto wǝ kpii kǝ nyiyǝ ŋ pɛɛlɩ ŋ koonu asaatiitǝpǝ. Ŋkǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ ŋ pǝǝ fǝ lǝ kpɛɛmʊrʊwǝ ceŋceŋ ko, paa tǝ fǝ kʊla we, vǝ́ yǝ lee yee wǝ we, lah ziɔŋrǝ lah mǝ tɔɔ lǝ bɔrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ŋ wǝ ke kǝto wǝ́ nǝ nyáa mwara laŋpooyǝ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi epǝ we pǝ láa lɔ laŋpooyǝ we, pǝ ya pǝ lée yee Worokoyǝ la kǝnǝnɛkǝ rǝ, kǝ pǝ yee kǝ sɩsiɛrɩ. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Nǝ mwara nyi ri ŋ nyi lo tuwǝ nǝ re ŋwǝ wǝ. Nǝ mwara nǝ laŋpooyǝ nǝ koonu alaŋpoolɔtǝpǝ. Nǝ kpǝ nǝ gbǝrǝ nǝ koonu epǝ we pǝ láa lɔ gbǝrǝ wǝ. Nǝ pɛɛlɩ nǝ koonu epǝ we wǝ kaamǝ kǝ nǝ pɛɛlɩ nǝ koonu wǝ. Nǝ kǝ epǝ we pǝ kaamǝ ǝkǝkǝ wǝ.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taa lá kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Nǝ pee re rɛ lo wǝtookpǝ rɛ, we tuwǝ ceŋceŋ wǝ lée ri wǝtookpǝ wǝ koonu nǝ wǝ kaamǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, nǝ taa awɛ lǝ kǝǝwǝ. Yǝ we ŋ náa taa enyituturupǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ we, le yee Mose le seyǝ we lo ko to rǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Esepǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ ne kpii ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Pee yee kǝtienaakǝ amaa paa yɩɩ vúurǝ, paa wʊ nyiyǝ, paa yɩɩ, paa mwɛɛrɩ lá kɛrɩyǝ lo tuwǝ le nimirǝ», mǝŋ esetuturupǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ we, pǝ la ca gʊʊrǝ pǝ kpii rǝ dierǝ sa jeŋceŋ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Taa lá kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ mǝŋ lá wɛ kǝtǝ». <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Yǝ we ŋ náa taa na kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ we, lǝŋ yee no turɔɔrɔɔwǝ. Kǝto mǝŋ a láa taa lá kɛrɩyǝ lǝ kǝǝwǝ we, e le yee a la saŋ rǝ Mose le seyǝ we milimili.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpaka e tii ǝ mǝ rǝŋ Kǝriso lǝ ǝpǝkǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nǝ fǝ tuwǝ sa kpuŋkpuruŋ duturǝ ɖi nǝ cii eniyǝ we mǝrǝ le kpii wǝ. Eniyǝ yǝ lo ro kǝ nǝ saanǝ rǝ ne eniŋrieyǝ! Duturǝ ɖi eniyǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ nah lɔ ŋ koonu lǝ we, yǝ lǝ kǝlǝ mǝ lǝ rǝkǝsa yǝ le teeri eniyǝ we la lɔ̀ Kǝriso lo nunu wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Dumurǝ lo ru lo ko ŋpa, ǝrǝkǝ kǝ lah kaalǝ. Nǝ pǝ kǝ la wɛɛ mǝ onuŋtumutuyǝ le eyeekǝ, kǝ lǝ fǝ akɔŋtuyǝ we pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ pǝ ŋ yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ rǝ wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ mǝrǝ we, lo po. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Nǝ pǝ kǝ le re lah wɛ sɩsiɛrɩ mǝŋ enyipǝ pǝ kpii rǝ jɔkɔŋrǝ la wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ mǝrǝ kǝtǝ, ŋkǝ rǝ nuŋtumuwǝ mǝrǝ. Rɛ ŋ pǝǝ tǝ ŋ yee erikpaakǝ, rɛ ŋ pǝǝ tǝ ŋ piemu ǝfǝŋpǝ. Nǝ pǝǝ tǝ nǝ tii nuŋruyeetǝfɔrʊrǝ. Nǝ sǝ́ŋ akpaŋyǝ mǝ wǝtɛlɩkpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Nǝ fǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso lǝ wǝlǝkpǝ nǝ kpii mǝŋ kǝkpakǝ kǝtǝ. Nǝ pǝǝ tǝ nǝ maa nǝ otucakpɛɛrɔɔrɔɔyǝ we yǝ re nǝ yǝ kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Paa tɛŋ lǝ́ ǝtǝŋpǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Nǝ tɛɛnɩ nǝ lɔ nyiyǝ we ŋ naa lɛnyɩ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ mǝrǝ wǝ, nǝ pee tiini dierǝ mǝ ŋwǝ ru rǝ no oyupuyǝ oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Rɛ la lɔ lo nuŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋwǝ ŋ nóo koru eri tu ri ŋ tu, paa nyipʊŋpwayǝ ŋ naa lɛnyɩ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ we, ewetuyǝ sɔŋ wǝ́ ŋ née ri. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Nyiyǝ we ŋ née ri tu ri ŋ tu we, ŋ paa fʊʊ yǝ we nǝŋ wo gakǝ ŋ sǝǝlǝ. Wǝ́ nyiyǝ we nǝŋ wo gakǝ we, ŋ paa tɛŋ yǝ we ŋ née ri tu ri ŋ tu la wǝkpaŋkpǝ, duturǝ ɖi Worokoyǝ la tɛɛnɩ la lɔ yǝ we ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Ǝlǝ wǝ́ e ri, ŋlǝ́, kǝ a tɛŋ nyipʊŋpwayǝ rɛ la sʊmatǝyǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ wǝ? Ŋ ka tɔ ŋ yaa rǝ na kǝnǝnɛkǝ oo, amaa ŋ ka tɔɔ oo, wǝ lǝ fǝ no kulǝtǝyǝ. Wǝ́ láa lɛ ŋ tɔ ŋ yaa, duturǝ ɖi Kulǝtǝyǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ ŋ nóo toŋ ŋwǝ kǝ ŋ tɔ ŋ yaa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Enyirɛɛpǝ pǝ ya pǝ lóo pu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ ecirɛɛyǝ yǝ lo ru okuruyǝ yǝ le teeri arɛɛyǝ. Enyipʊŋpwapǝ pǝ ya pǝ lóo pu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ yǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ kaa rǝ. Wǝ kpii kǝ nyi ri ŋ nyi ŋ lɔ ŋ nuŋ rǝ na wɛ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tuwǝ we ŋ ya ŋ nóo pu we, wǝ kʊʊ. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yǝ we ŋ nǝ fǝ okuruyǝ ŋ no koonu jirǝ rɛ ceŋceŋ we, lée yee wǝ kǝ ŋ fǝ mǝ ŋ kǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ rǝ. Yǝ we ŋ née ri tu ri ŋ tu we, ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ lée yee wǝ mǝ ŋ kǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ rǝ, duturǝ ɖi lée ceeni Worokoyǝ rǝ ne keeriwǝ we kǝto. Nyiyǝ we ŋ nǝŋ ri oturɛɛyǝ we, lée yee wǝ mǝ ŋ kǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ rǝ, wǝ́ ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ lée ceeni Worokoyǝ rǝ wǝlo yurǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Rɛ lee kpii rǝ lǝh mǝrǝ ŋ kpii vɔrʊrǝ ŋ koonu na wɛ, wǝ́ rɛ lǝŋ kpǝ́ ŋ koonu na wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Mǝŋ le kpii vɔrʊrǝ we, le kpii vɔrʊrǝ lo koonu Kulǝtǝyǝ. Kǝto wǝ ke ri le kpii vɔrʊrǝ oo, wǝ ke ri yǝ lǝ́ǝ kpǝ́ oo, le ri Kulǝtǝyǝ la anɛŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Duturǝ ɖi Kǝriso lǝ kpǝ́ wǝ́ ŋ na lɛ ŋ na saanǝ kǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ ri enyiǝtǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ kpii vɔrʊrǝ lo Kulǝtǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Wǝ́ ŋlǝ́, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a ya láa tɛŋ lá kɛrɩyǝ la wǝkpaŋkpǝ wǝ? Ŋlǝ́, kǝ́ kǝto wǝ́ a ya láa fʊʊ lá kɛrɩyǝ ǝ mǝ ŋ sǝǝlǝ wǝ? Loh kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le kpii yǝ lóo ko lo ko ru rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnyɩŋkǝ, kǝ ŋ tɛŋ lǝ akpaŋyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kpiikǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Ǝtǝ Woroko la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Kǝ́ ŋ́ nya ŋ́ kpii vɔrʊrǝ ko we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">anyɩmaasɩpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lah pa kʊŋ rǝ mǝ kǝnyɩŋkǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">kǝ pǝlo kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ ŋ kǝ mǝ.»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kǝto we, nyi ri ŋ nyi rǝ lǝh mǝrǝ lah ka pɔ Worokoyǝ la amayǝ ŋ ru rǝ tuwǝ yǝ we ŋwǝŋwǝ ŋ ne yee wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Kǝto nǝ pǝ kǝ la wɛɛ mǝ awɛ la wǝkpaŋtɛŋkpǝ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ROM 14:13">Rɛ ŋ pee re na kɛrɩyǝ ŋ kpii rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 14:13">Bomu nǝ fǝ nǝ tɛɛ rǝ nǝ wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋnǝ nǝ nyǝŋ yee tuwǝ rɛ wǝ lóo koonu kǝ nǝ kɛrɩyǝ ŋ siɛrɩ rǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝmaakǝ amaa ŋ nyarǝ lɔnuŋrǝ ŋ co. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ŋ́ cii wǝ sɩsiɛrɩ ǝkǝnǝŋ tǝrɛ wǝ lee kpii wǝ ri tukpǝlǝwǝ wǝ koonu epǝ we pǝ la lɔ Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu pǝ lo nuŋ wǝ. Paa mǝŋ rɛ lo pu wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ tuwǝ sa ǝnǝ wǝ ri tukpǝlǝwǝ we, wǝ láa siɛrɩ wǝ yee tukpǝlǝwǝ wǝ koonu ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Mǝŋ keeriwǝ rɛ a láa nyɩɩ e mǝ ŋ ri wǝ lée kpii lá kɛrɩyǝ la awɛɛlɩkǝ we, wǝ la kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋlǝ́ a lǝŋ taa nǝ kǝǝwǝ. Pee ri keeriwǝ rɛ wǝ lóo kuŋ kǝ rɛ ŋ lǝǝrǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ wǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Kǝriso lǝ kpǝ́ rǝ yǝ we lo yurǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Kǝto we, nǝ poo koonu kǝ tuwǝ we wǝ ponu mǝ nǝ we, enyipʊŋpwapǝ pǝ tɛŋ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ pǝ ru rǝ wǝlo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kpiikǝ Worokoyǝ le wǝpilirikpǝ rǝ lah vɔrʊrǝ we, wǝ lee ri keeriwǝ le dierǝ amaa ǝfǝŋpǝ le dierǝ. Wǝ ri rǝ wǝkʊʊkpǝ, wǝtaarǝkpǝ mǝ faawǝ. Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lóo koonu ŋyǝ otuyǝ sa. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Yǝ we ŋ náa sʊma Kǝriso rǝ wǝlǝkpǝ sa we, no tuwǝ wǝ ponu mǝ Worokoyǝ. Wǝ́ enyipǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ láa tɛŋ no tuceeceewǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kǝto we, kǝ la mǝ nyɩɩ le mǝ yee otuyǝ we yǝ lóo koonu wǝtaarǝkpǝ wǝ́ yǝ lóo toŋ otuturupǝ kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ lɛnyɩ rǝ pǝla lɔnuŋrǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Paa kɔlʊ mǝ keeriwǝ kǝto kǝ ǝ pǝlǝ Worokoyǝ la kǝnǝnɛkǝ oo! Kǝceece, yǝ lóo koru eri ekeeriyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ paape, mǝŋ keeriwǝ rɛ e lée ri wǝ lóo koonu kǝ la kɛrɩyǝ ŋ tɔɔ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ we, we wǝ loo poŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Tuwǝ wǝ ri ceeceewǝ wǝ kaamǝ: Nǝ poo wo gakǝ, nǝ poo ŋuŋ ǝfǝŋpǝ, nǝ pee yee tupʊŋpwawǝ rɛ wǝ lóo koonu kǝ nǝ kɛrɩyǝ ŋ tɔɔ rǝ na lɔnuŋrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Tuwǝ we a ya lóo pu o mǝ ŋ ru rǝ otuyǝ sa we, wǝ ri rǝ ŋnǝ mǝ Worokoyǝ le dierǝ. Nyiyǝ we ŋ nǝŋ tɔɔ na wɛ la bɔrǝ rǝ no tuwǝ ŋ na saa ŋ na pɔrʊ ŋ yee we, yǝ we lo co yǝ! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Paa mǝŋ rɛ leh ri keeriwǝ rɛ wǝ́ paa ŋ ya ŋ nǝ́ǝ tǝmǝlǝ rǝ wǝle erikǝ we, Worokoyǝ la tɔɔ nǝ wǝ la bɔrǝ. Duturǝ ɖi laa lɔ ŋ nuŋ rǝ na wɛ lǝ mǝrǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ keeriwǝ we ŋ neh ri we, pǝ lǝŋ kpǝlǝ wǝ. Wǝ́ tu ri ŋ tu nyiyǝ ŋ née yee lɔnuŋrǝ laa kʊla we, wǝ ri rǝ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Yee tuwǝ wǝ láa ca lǝ́ ǝtǝŋpǝ la kpɛɛwǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Ŋlǝ epǝ we lǝ lǝǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ mǝrǝ we, wǝ kpii kǝ lo toŋ epǝ we pǝ lǝǝ lǝmǝ okopiyǝ rǝ pǝla akparaayǝ mǝrǝ. Ŋkǝ tuwǝ we wǝ láa ca lǝ kpɛɛwǝ wǝ́ yǝ leh mǝ yee. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Nyi ri ŋ nyi rǝ lǝh mǝrǝ mǝ ŋ yee tuwǝ wǝ láa ca na kɛrɩyǝ la kpɛɛwǝ fǝ koonu ne ceeceewǝ, kǝ ŋ nya fɛɛ ŋ nya okopiyǝ rǝ lɔnuŋrǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Duturǝ ɖi Kǝriso laa pa taa rǝ ŋwǝŋwǝ na nɛŋwǝ. Paa mǝŋ kǝ́ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ kǝtǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ: «Afǝfɛɛpiyǝ we enyipǝ pǝ ka ŋ fɛɛpɩ lǝ́ we, yǝ la pa tɛɛ rǝ mǝ». <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Tu ri ŋ tu wǝ kpii rǝ Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ mǝrǝ we, pǝ ŋʊ̀rʊ yǝ rǝ gakarǝ pǝ tǝ̀nǝ pǝ pa kaŋ lǝ otuyǝ rǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ sa wǝ lóo koonu lǝ atɔyaakǝ mǝ turutawǝ kǝ la nya fɛɛ la tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Worokoyǝ we ŋ nóo koonu nyiyǝ la atɔyaakǝ mǝ turutawǝ we, ŋ koonu kǝ nǝ lǝ wǝnyuŋceŋceŋ mǝ awɛ, kǝ nǝ mǝ yee mǝŋ kǝ́ Yesu Kǝriso ŋ ke ŋ yee kǝtǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ nǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ nǝ fǝ kpɛɛwǝ ceŋceŋ nǝ mǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ, loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso lǝ Tǝyǝ.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ lɔ awɛ sɩsiɛrɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Kǝto we, nǝ lɔ awɛ mǝŋ kǝ́ Kǝriso ŋ na lɔ nǝ kǝtǝ. Nǝ mǝ yee wǝ ǝnǝ kǝ enyipǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ ŋ kǝ Worokoyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née tíi nǝ wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ Kǝriso la pa sʊma Oyudatǝpǝ kǝ wǝ pɔrʊ wǝ kaŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ Worokoyǝ ri nʊkɔrǝlǝtǝyǝ. Saŋ rǝ wǝlo oŋuŋkǝ we, le si ɖurǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ la akayǝ we ŋ cò pǝlǝ ǝtǝtǝpǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />La lɛ lǝ pǝ kǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ rǝ na lɛsiɛrɩwǝ kǝto. Duturǝ ɖi Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Wǝ kǝto ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ kǝ lǝ́ rǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">kǝ ŋ́ mǝ ŋ nɔŋ mǝ ŋ kǝ lá nyɩŋrǝ».<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ we wǝ lǝ tǝ wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Ŋnǝ epǝ we nǝ nyee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ, nǝ nya faawǝ nǝ kʊla mǝ Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we ŋ na saa ŋ na pɔrʊ wǝ!»<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ we wǝ lǝ tǝ wǝ la tɛŋ rǝ fɛɛrɛɛwǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«Ǝkǝŋyǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ le enyipǝ, nǝ kǝ Ǝtǝ Woroko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">wǝkpǝŋkpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ kǝ ŋwǝ!»<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ezaya ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Yese le pilepiyǝ rɛ loh po ru mǝŋ kǝ́ pwɛrɛpwɛkuuruwǝ wǝ lóo pwoŋ kǝtǝ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Leh pe yi kǝ ŋ ri piliyǝ ŋ koonu wǝkpǝŋkpǝ we wǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">kǝ wǝkpǝŋkpǝ sa wǝ tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ ŋwǝ».<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Worokoyǝ we ŋ nóo koonu nyɩmaasɩyǝ ŋ náa tɛɛ kpɛɛwǝ rǝ ŋwǝ we, ŋ koonu kǝ nǝ nya faawǝ mǝ wǝtaarǝkpǝ ŋpa mǝ kǝ́ nǝ nya lɔ ŋwǝ nǝ nyo nuŋ kǝto. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ nǝ nya fɛɛ nǝ nya kpɛɛtɛɛwǝ ŋpa saŋ rǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lo okopiyǝ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwǝ kǝto Pɔlʊ ŋ na ŋʊrʊ ǝnǝ wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, ŋmǝŋmǝ ŋ́ cii wǝ fee ŋ́ ru rǝ nǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, nǝ nye ri enyiceeceepǝ milimili. Nǝ cii tu ri ŋ tu wǝ kpii kǝ nǝ yee wǝ, wǝ́ nǝ nyóo koru eci nǝ kaŋ awɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Paape rǝ mǝ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa mǝrǝ la afɛɛrɛɛyǝ we, ŋ́ no tu turuwǝ ŋ́ na ŋʊrʊ otuyǝ we nǝ nya karǝ nǝ nya pa tɛlɩ ŋ́ ne kpii kǝ ŋ́ fǝ ŋ́ taalǝ nǝ yǝ. Ŋ́ ne yee wǝ ǝnǝ rǝ lɛsiɛrɩwǝ we Worokoyǝ ŋ ne yee mǝ kǝto. <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />Duturǝ ɖi lǝ fǝ mǝ le yee Yesu Kǝriso la sʊmatǝyǝ lo koonu epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ. La saa mǝ mǝŋ toolutǝyǝ rɛ, kǝ ŋ́ tɛŋ Worokoyǝ le Dieceeceerǝ sa ŋ́ tíi epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ siɛrɩ pǝ yee toolutuwǝ we wǝ láa ca Worokoyǝ la kpɛɛwǝ, ǝkǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ la kʊʊ lǝ tǝnǝ ŋwǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Kǝ́ wǝ ri ŋlǝ mǝ Kǝriso yǝ le yee nyiceŋceŋ kǝto we, ŋ́ nóo koru arɛɛrɩ mǝ mǝ wɛ rǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ we ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née yee mǝ ŋ koonu Worokoyǝ lo oŋuŋkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Duturǝ ɖi mǝŋ ŋ́ nóo tu turuwǝ ŋ́ wɛɛlɩ ŋ́ ru rǝ tuwǝ rɛ we, we tuwǝ we Kǝriso ŋ ne yee ŋ na saŋ rǝ mǝ oŋuŋkǝ ceŋceŋ. Kǝriso lo koonu wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ pǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ pǝ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ. Le yee wǝ saŋ rǝ etieyǝ we ŋ́ na tɛŋ mǝ anǝnɛyǝ we ŋ́ ne yee wǝ, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />saŋ rǝ otucovurǝ kpookpoo mǝ Worokoyǝ la Wɛɛrǝ lo okopiyǝ. Kaa wǝǝ ŋ́ tɛnɩ Dieceeceerǝ we ru rǝ Kǝriso ŋ́ tɛ̀lɩ rǝ fɛɛ ri ŋ fɛɛ, fǝ rǝ Yerusalɛmǝ ko ru ǝrǝ Iliri la gaarǝ we. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Paape tuwǝ ŋ́ kǝ ŋ pǝ́ wǝ kaamǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ, ŋ́ tɛŋ Dieceeceerǝ we rǝ afɛɛyǝ we pǝ foo nuŋ Kǝriso la nyɩŋrǝ pǝ tǝnǝ ceŋceŋ ko. Mǝŋkǝsa we, kǝ wǝ pee pe ri ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋmǝ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nóo co giriŋrǝ mǝ ŋ tɛɛ rǝ nyipʊŋpwayǝ rɛ la kǝtɛɛkǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Mǝŋkǝsa we, o lóo turu ŋ́ siimǝ tuwǝ we Wǝŋʊrʊkenikenikpǝ wǝ la tɛŋ wǝ. Wǝ la tɛŋ ǝkǝnǝŋ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«Epǝ we pǝ loo nuŋ pǝ tɛŋ na tǝrɛ we, pǝ lah pa nyɩŋ ŋwǝ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">wǝ́ epǝ we pǝ loo nuŋ pǝ wɛɛlɩ pǝ ru rǝ ŋwǝ we, pǝ loh po nuŋ wǝlo duturǝ».<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ŋ wǝ tuwǝ sa wǝ lǝ sǝŋ mǝ gʊŋrǝ kǝpakakǝpaka kǝ ŋ́ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ wǝǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Paa rǝkǝsa we, ŋ́ na lɛ mǝ kǝnǝnɛkǝ rǝ akaayǝ sa. Wǝ ya wǝ láa ca mǝ kpɛɛwǝ ŋpa ŋ́ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ wǝ la lɔ acɛŋyǝ, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />wǝ́ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ ŋ́ yee wǝ rǝkǝsa. Vǝ́ ŋ́ noh ko Sǝpania we, ŋ́ nǝh pǝ fǝ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. Duturǝ ɖi ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ nǝ po toŋ mǝ ŋ́ fǝ ŋ́ ko gǝŋrǝ sa. Ŋ́ neh pe tii rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ kpekperee. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Paa rǝkǝsa we, ŋ́ noh ko Yerusalɛmǝ ŋ ke yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ ŋ koonu Worokoyǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we kǝ kpii rǝ tǝŋtǝǝwǝ sa wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kpiikǝ ekǝrisotǝpǝ we rǝ Makedonia mǝ Akayi ŋpǝŋpǝ pǝ lǝ fǝ pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ pǝla wɛ ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋpǝ pǝ lóo koonu otuyǝ pǝ fǝ pǝ toŋ ariariatǝpǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ ekǝrisotǝpǝ mǝrǝ rǝ Yerusalɛmǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ŋpǝŋpǝ pǝ lǝ fǝ pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ pǝla wɛ pǝ yee wǝ, paa rǝ anʊkɔrǝyǝ we, wǝ ri rǝ wǝtookpǝ wǝ́ pǝ re pǝ. Duturǝ ɖi Oyudatǝpǝ we pǝ la siɛrɩ pǝ le yee ekǝrisotǝpǝ we, pǝ lǝ fǝ pǝla wɛɛrǝ lo otulǝmǝyǝ pǝ lǝ sǝpǝ mǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ wǝ. Kǝto wǝ kpii kǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ fǝ pǝlo otulǝmǝyǝ rǝ wɛlɛŋrǝ pǝ toŋ pǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Vǝ́ ŋ́ ne yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ sa ŋ́ na lɛ, wǝ́ ŋ́ nǝ fǝ otukoonuyǝ sa ŋ́ ne ke kpii pǝ rǝ akaakǝ we, o lóo turu ŋ́ nǝ fǝ gʊŋrǝ ŋ́ noh ko Sǝpania kǝ ŋ́ pǝ fǝ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Wǝ́ ŋ́ cii wǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ vǝ́ ŋ́ no furu we, ŋ́ neh pe fii nǝ kpǝŋ mǝ Kǝriso la wǝpɛɛrɩkpǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Paape we, lǝh ǝtǝŋ, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɔɔ mǝ ŋ kpɛɛ nǝ saŋ rǝ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso mǝ Wɛɛkenikenirǝ lǝ kǝǝtaawǝ we lóo koonu lǝ we, nǝ fia nǝ toŋ mǝ kǝ la mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ lo koonu Worokoyǝ rǝ mǝ yurǝ. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Nǝ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ nǝ koonu mǝ kǝ ŋ́ paa ka tɔɔ rǝ Oyudeyatǝpǝ sa pǝ laa lɔ Kǝriso pǝ nuŋ la wǝkaakpǝ. Nǝ lɛ nǝ mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ nǝ koonu mǝ kǝ otoŋkǝ sa ŋ́ noh ko mǝ rǝ Yerusalɛmǝ we, alɔnuŋtǝpǝ we pǝ ka lɔ kǝ sɩsiɛrɩ. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Mǝŋkǝsa we, ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ pǝ nǝ kpǝŋ mǝ faawǝ. Wǝ́ mǝŋ Worokoyǝ láa tɛɛnɩ we, ŋ́ keh pe tii ŋ́ wɛɛ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ tɩpɩrɩ. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Worokoyǝ we ŋ nóo koonu wǝtaarǝkpǝ we, ŋ tii ŋ kʊla mǝ nǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ! Amɛnǝ!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlʊ le ceeni enyipǝ kpookpoo la maŋ rǝ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ nǝ́ǝ fǝ lah paatɛyǝ Fwebe ŋ ya ŋ née yee Worokoyǝ la anǝnɛyǝ rǝ Kǝriso la wǝcakukpǝ we wǝ kpii rǝ Saŋkǝre mǝ ŋ kpii nǝ rǝ akaakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Nǝ lɔ ŋwǝ mǝŋ kǝ́ wǝ kaamǝ kǝ alɔnuŋtǝpǝ pǝ yee wǝ kǝtǝ, kpiikǝ ŋ ri Kulǝtǝyǝ la nɛŋ kǝto. Tu ri ŋ tu lǝ mǝrǝ ŋ nǝ́ǝ pǝ́ nǝ otoŋkǝ we, nǝ toŋ ŋwǝ. Ŋwǝŋwǝ lo toŋ enyipǝ wa, wǝ́ ŋ no toŋ ŋmǝ ŋkpɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Nǝ ceeni Pǝrisǝka mǝ Akila, pǝ lée yee anǝnɛyǝ pǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ mǝ yǝ ŋ sʊma Yesu Kǝriso wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Pǝ fǝ̀ pǝlo yurǝ pǝ kòonu kǝ pǝ lɔ mǝ vɔrʊrǝ. Wǝ́ ŋkǝ ŋmǝ ceŋceŋ ŋ́ ya ŋ́ née ceeni pǝ. Alɔnuŋtǝpǝ la acakuyǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ yǝ kpii rǝ epǝ we pǝ lee ri Oyudatǝpǝ lǝ mǝrǝ we, yǝ ya yǝ lée ceeni pǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Nǝ lɛ nǝ ceeni zʊmarǝ lǝ kǝkpǝŋkǝ we kǝ lóo ku rǝ pǝla nyarǝwǝ. Nǝ ceeni mǝ kǝǝtaatǝyǝ Epanɛtǝ, ŋwǝ ŋ ri nyisǝsǝŋyǝ ŋ lɔ̀ Kǝriso ŋ nunu rǝ Azi la gaarǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Nǝ ceeni Marɩya, le yee anǝnɛyǝ ŋpa lo koonu nǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Nǝ ceeni Aŋdǝronika mǝ Yunia mǝ otuulupǝ. Ŋlǝ mǝ pǝ le ke kpii rǝ gukpɛɛkpǝ. Enyikpiipǝ rɛ pǝ lo ru okuruyǝ pǝ lǝǝwe, pǝ sìɛrɩ pǝ yeli ekǝrisotǝpǝ pǝ conu pǝ kòonu mǝ.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Nǝ ceeni Aŋpilatu, mǝ kǝǝtaatǝyǝ rǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Nǝ ceeni Irebɛŋ ŋ née yee kǝnǝnɛkǝ mǝ ŋ kʊla mǝ lǝ yǝ ŋ sʊma Kǝriso, mǝ mǝ pwetaayǝ Setaki <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Nǝ ceeni Apelɛsɩ, ŋwǝ ŋ na pɔrʊ ŋ na kaŋ kǝceece ǝkǝnǝŋ ŋ na lɔ Kǝriso ŋ no nuŋ wǝ. Nǝ ceeni Aritobula la anyarǝtǝpǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Nǝ ceeni mǝ tuuluyǝ Erodiɔŋ. Nǝ ceeni Narǝsisǝ la anyarǝtǝpǝ we pǝ la lɔ Kulǝtǝyǝ pǝ lo nuŋ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Nǝ ceeni Terifeni mǝ Terifose. Pǝ ya pǝ lée yee anǝnɛyǝ ŋpaŋpa pǝ ŋ koonu Kulǝtǝyǝ. Nǝ ceeni mǝ kǝǝtaatǝyǝ Pereside ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ le yee anǝnɛyǝ ŋpa lo koonu Kulǝtǝyǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Nǝ ceeni Rufu ŋ née yee anǝnɛyǝ sɩsiɛrɩ mǝ ŋ koonu Kulǝtǝyǝ mǝ ne lee, ŋ lɛ ŋ ri leeyǝ ŋ koonu mǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Nǝ ceeni Asɛŋkerite, Felegɔŋ, Ɛrǝmɛsɩ, Patǝrobasɩ mǝ Ɛrǝmasɩ, mǝŋ lǝh ǝtǝŋpǝ we pǝ kpii pǝ kʊla mǝ pǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Nǝ ceeni Filolɔkǝ mǝ Yulio, Nere mǝ na paatɛ, Olɛŋpa mǝ alɔnuŋtǝpǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ kpii pǝ kʊla mǝ pǝ wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Nǝ ceeni awɛ sɩsiɛrɩ mǝ kǝǝtaawǝ mǝŋ apaanʊpǝ mǝ apaatɛpǝ kǝtǝ. Kǝriso la wǝcakukpǝ we kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ wǝ lée ceeni nǝ.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlʊ le ci la kaŋ alɔnuŋtǝpǝ we pǝ kpii rǝ Roma wǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Lǝh ǝtǝŋ, ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɔɔ mǝ ŋ kpɛɛ nǝ, nǝ yee yurǝ rǝ epǝ we pǝ lée kpii wǝsǝpǝkpǝ. Pǝ le yi pǝ la tɛɛ rǝ otuyǝ we pǝ la kaŋ nǝ, a pǝ ŋ siɛrɩ alɔnuŋtǝpǝ lo yurǝ rǝ Worokoyǝ. Nǝ ruu nǝ ru rǝ pǝlǝ kpǝŋ. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Duturǝ ɖi ŋpǝ enyipǝ sa wǝrʊʊkpǝ pǝ lǝŋ sʊma loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Kǝriso, pǝ láa sʊma rǝ pǝla lɛrǝ. Pǝ lǝ́ǝ fǝ pǝle etieraŋyǝ mǝ pǝle eciatɛŋkǝ pǝ ŋ tǝǝnǝ enyipǝ we pǝ lee ci tu ri ŋ tu wǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Nyi ri ŋ nyi cii kǝ́ nǝ nyóo co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ nǝ nyǝ ŋ fǝ wǝ! Kǝto ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa nya faawǝ rǝ nǝ yurǝ. Paape ŋ́ nǝ pǝ́ nǝ sie nimirǝ nǝ koonu tuceeceewǝ le eyeekǝ, kǝ nǝ sǝ́ŋ turɔɔrɔɔwǝ le eyeekǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Wǝ lǝŋ panǝ, Worokoyǝ we ŋ nóo koonu wǝtaarǝkpǝ we, lǝ́ǝ tǝǝ Satana kɩrɩkɔkɩrɩkɔ rǝ nǝ akparǝyǝ kǝnǝŋkǝ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa mwɛŋ nyuŋkpǝ ǝkǝnǝŋ loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu ŋ tǝ mǝ ŋ yee nǝ lɛsiɛrɩwǝ! <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Mǝ kɛrɩnǝnɛyeetǝyǝ Timote lée ceeni nǝ. Mǝ otuulupǝ Lusio, Yasɔŋ mǝ Sosipatɛrǝ ŋpǝ ŋkpɛ pǝ lée ceeni nǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ŋmǝ Tɛrǝsio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛrǝsio ŋ ri Pɔlʊ la ŋʊrʊtǝyǝ.</char></note> ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa ŋʊrʊ kǝfwɛɛkǝ sa we, ŋ́ née ceeni nǝ rǝ Kulǝtǝyǝ we ŋ nǝ fǝ lǝ ŋ ne yee nyiceŋceŋ lǝ mǝrǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo lée ceeni nǝ. Ŋwǝ ŋ náa lɔ mǝ kǝsǝǝkǝ rǝ nǝ kpǝŋ wǝ. Na nyarǝwǝ wǝ́ alɔnuŋtǝpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lóo ku wǝ. Erasǝ ŋ ri tǝŋtǝǝwǝ sa la sɩkatǝnǝtǝyǝ lée ceeni nǝ. Lah paanʊyǝ Kwatuse ŋwǝ ŋkpɛ lée ceeni nǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Loh Kulǝtǝyǝ Yesu Kǝriso la lɛsiɛrɩwǝ wǝ tii wǝ kʊla mǝ nǝ kpǝlo! Amɛnǝ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fɛɛkǝwǝ 24 wǝ lee kpii rǝ wǝŋʊrʊkuukuukpǝ wa lǝ mǝrǝ.</char></note>]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlʊ lǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Wǝ kpii kǝ lǝ kǝ Worokoyǝ! Lóo koru ekpii nǝ lɔnuŋrǝ lo okopiyǝ saŋ rǝ Dieceeceerǝ sa ŋ́ ya ŋ́ náa tɛŋ ǝkǝ la wɛɛlɩ lo ru rǝ Yesu Kǝriso wǝ. Ŋrǝ Dieceeceerǝ sa la lɛ la pɔrʊ Worokoyǝ lo yupurǝ la kaŋ. Yupurǝ sa we, Worokoyǝ la ŋwaa rǝ ru ǝrǝ gakarǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Paa rǝkǝsa we, akpɛɛnuŋtɛŋtǝpǝ la wǝfwɛɛkpǝ wǝ lo koonu yupurǝ sa lo ru wǝnyɩɩnɩkpǝ, mǝŋ kǝ́ Worokoyǝ we ŋ kpii kǝkpakǝkpa ŋ na tɛŋ wǝ kǝtǝ. Mǝŋkǝsa we wǝkpǝŋkpǝ kpǝlo kɩɩkɩ pǝ lée ci tuŋwaawǝ sa, kǝ pǝ nya fɛɛ pǝ lɔ ŋwǝ pǝ nuŋ kǝ pǝ ŋ co kǝtukoŋkǝ rǝ ŋwǝ. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Worokoyǝ we ceŋceŋ ŋ sieni nimirǝ ŋ kaamǝ ǝkǝkǝ kǝkpakǝkpa saŋ rǝ Yesu Kǝriso! Amɛnǝ.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>